      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "均线（如 EMA 20 / 50 / 200）： 帮你快速\n看清当前是牛市还是熊市趋势。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "均线（如 EMA 20 / 50 / 200）： 帮你快速看清当前是牛市还是熊市趋势。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
