      "versionNonce": 1939760905,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Gimini推荐的开源资料：\n\n    ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Gimini推荐的开源资料：\n\n    ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "zXwVzCPiFEVzwmJEGVWZY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 176.49995168050134,
      "y": 950.1388346354166,
      "width": 1210.77978515625,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRop",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1921224203,
      "version": 135,
      "versionNonce": 1764108807,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GitHub 地址搜索： SpiralDevelopment/Awesome-Crypto-Trading\n\n它是怎么样的： 这就是币圈的 \"Awesome List\"（精选资源导航）。它不是一篇文章，而是把加密货币交易切分成了极其严格的模块：\n\n基础概念 -> 技术分析 (TA) 专项 -> 基本面分析 (FA) 专项 -> 模拟器与工具。\n\n怎么学： 顺着它的 Technical Analysis (TA) 目录往下走，里面推荐的每一个链接都是开源社区筛选出的、最直白好懂的经典图解教程。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "GitHub 地址搜索： SpiralDevelopment/Awesome-Crypto-Trading\n\n它是怎么样的： 这就是币圈的 \"Awesome List\"（精选资源导航）。它不是一篇文章，而是把加密货币交易切分成了极其严格的模块：\n\n基础概念 -> 技术分析 (TA) 专项 -> 基本面分析 (FA) 专项 -> 模拟器与工具。\n\n怎么学： 顺着它的 Technical Analysis (TA) 目录往下走，里面推荐的每一个链接都是开源社区筛选出的、最直白好懂的经典图解教程。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a2ETolwNP_TGLFhIb-UmA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 186.87016805013025,
      "y": 1165.555475870768,
      "width": 504.2596435546875,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRoq",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 819833835,
      "version": 143,
      "versionNonce": 1127128553,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GitHub 地址搜索： PacktPublishing/Zero-to-Hero-in-\nCryptocurrency-Trading",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "GitHub 地址搜索： PacktPublishing/Zero-to-Hero-in-Cryptocurrency-Trading",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "WxRwKZDjMtsfaH8A_1dxn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 176.59999593098962,
      "y": 1235.555475870768,
      "width": 524.7999877929688,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRor",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 370383941,
      "version": 143,
      "versionNonce": 1124159783,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "它是怎么样的： 这是一个专门带新手“从零到英雄”的开源图\n书配套库。它的厉害之处在于，它不仅有系统的理论，还在\n仓库里提供了一个 完整的、全彩色的技术分析图表与K线形\n态的 PDF 指南（可以在其仓库直接下载）。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "它是怎么样的： 这是一个专门带新手“从零到英雄”的开源图书配套库。它的厉害之处在于，它不仅有系统的理论，还在仓库里提供了一个 完整的、全彩色的技术分析图表与K线形态的 PDF 指南（可以在其仓库直接下载）。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "fmmtCwu6ttbaOsBkCrhp0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 172.259999593099,
      "y": 1393.055475870768,
      "width": 533.47998046875,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRos",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1001846411,
      "version": 143,
      "versionNonce": 1700067529,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "怎么学： 虽然它后半部分带有一点 Python 编程，但前半部\n分对于交易心理学、K线指标解构的思维导图和图表非常系\n统，适合拿来当做你的通关教材。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "怎么学： 虽然它后半部分带有一点 Python 编程，但前半部分对于交易心理学、K线指标解构的思维导图和图表非常系统，适合拿来当做你的通关教材。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bsRGm4QKOoKNSSpXMskSI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 185.00351460774743,
      "y": 1515.5555521647134,
      "width": 524.65966796875,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
