      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GitHub 地址搜索： alimogh/crypto-trading-bot-tutorial",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "GitHub 地址搜索： alimogh/crypto-trading-bot-tutorial",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "f9qVpI_vffHpR9RRh2O51",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 179.999989827474,
      "y": 1561.3888346354165,
      "width": 533,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRou",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 910768747,
      "version": 112,
      "versionNonce": 1806497705,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "它是怎么样的： 别被它的名字 \"bot（机器人）\" 吓到了。这\n个项目的核心是一步一步教你如何把人的技术分析逻辑变成\n严谨的步骤。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "它是怎么样的： 别被它的名字 \"bot（机器人）\" 吓到了。这个项目的核心是一步一步教你如何把人的技术分析逻辑变成严谨的步骤。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "zFO8-kgCE63Jt0Ga86oje",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 178.09999593098962,
      "y": 1668.8888346354165,
      "width": 536.7999877929688,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRov",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 432944581,
      "version": 112,
      "versionNonce": 729707367,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "怎么学： 它用极其大白话的语言解释了：什么是K线、什么\n是均线交叉、什么是真突破（Breakout）。对于完全不懂金\n融的新手，看这种“理工科程序员”写的交易解释，往往比看金\n融教授写的书更容易开窍，因为逻辑极其严密、没有废话。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "怎么学： 它用极其大白话的语言解释了：什么是K线、什么是均线交叉、什么是真突破（Breakout）。对于完全不懂金融的新手，看这种“理工科程序员”写的交易解释，往往比看金融教授写的书更容易开窍，因为逻辑极其严密、没有废话。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "t3GhBd_QbvTG8cG8J1DOm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 192.37997563680017,
      "y": 1805.5555521647134,
      "width": 528.239990234375,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRow",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1877986859,
      "version": 83,
      "versionNonce": 677517961,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "还有一个最直观的学习方式：直接看大佬开源的“画线和指标\n代码”。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "还有一个最直观的学习方式：直接看大佬开源的“画线和指标代码”。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "WTJJCL3N54CahOc5FaFEc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 191.60003789265954,
      "y": 1888.0555521647134,
      "width": 529.7998657226562,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRox",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 576437765,
      "version": 83,
      "versionNonce": 441020039,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "当你在 TradingView 或者币安/OKX 的图表上时，可以注意\n到数以万计的指标是开源的（它们由一种叫 Pine Script 的\n语言编写）。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "当你在 TradingView 或者币安/OKX 的图表上时，可以注意到数以万计的指标是开源的（它们由一种叫 Pine Script 的语言编写）。",
