      "seed": 93220437,
      "version": 142,
      "versionNonce": 614906055,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "一个案例：你来到了人生地不熟的地方，在一个小吃街你想找到好次的美食",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "一个案例：你来到了人生地不熟的地方，在一个小吃街你想找到好次的美食",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "g1aF5fYjlgEjCAL9Wp3yi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1774.6064573015487,
      "y": 495.3254125685926,
      "width": 466.09197998046875,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
