      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "技术分析(TA)",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "技术分析(TA)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hZDvC3W_kcodFW1FtDSfW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2330.6064573015487,
      "y": 669.9920995803113,
      "width": 648,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRp6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1890565493,
      "version": 61,
      "versionNonce": 246637801,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "即根据当前趋势（即市场偏好）寻找机会",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "即根据当前趋势（即市场偏好）寻找机会",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0kqUA3gtfl5J_LDQRr4HH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1769.606518336705,
      "y": 873.8254125685926,
      "width": 1052,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRp7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 583451125,
      "version": 743,
      "versionNonce": 1951431207,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "任何研究方法都离不开一系列假设，技术分析也不例外,必须在交\n易市场时始终牢记这些假设,每种研究方法都有自己的优劣，这两\n种方法技巧截然不同，不可相提并论，但可以发生绝佳的投资机会",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "任何研究方法都离不开一系列假设，技术分析也不例外,必须在交易市场时始终牢记这些假设,每种研究方法都有自己的优劣，这两种方法技巧截然不同，不可相提并论，但可以发生绝佳的投资机会",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "PSPIRnMQQHc6BJr_IDkVM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1670.2728162493017,
      "y": 1086.5477229527064,
      "width": 396,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRp8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1517769469,
      "version": 106,
      "versionNonce": 313057225,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "技术分析的局限性和作用",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "技术分析的局限性和作用",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "wLRdwDIEszb-GpdmHZVm6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1853.9395871843603,
      "y": 1210.857097559677,
      "width": 995.9999999999999,
      "height": 161.51514226740056,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRp9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1319943261,
      "version": 226,
      "versionNonce": 1890360647,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "交易——技术分析最适合用于识别短期交易机会。不要使用技术分析\n来识别长期投资机会。长期投资机会最好通过基本面分析来识别。此\n外，如果您是基本面分析师，可以使用技术分析来校准入场点和出场\n点。",
      "fontSize": 32.30302845348011,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "交易——技术分析最适合用于识别短期交易机会。不要使用技术分析来识别长期投资机会。长期投资机会最好通过基本面分析来识别。此外，如果您是基本面分析师，可以使用技术分析来校准入场点和出场点。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "yAIwW2p0-TBdcI25ztMYr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1853.9557435181036,
      "y": 1441.9134816366527,
      "width": 982.6343133090758,
      "height": 121.13635670055042,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1288799219,
      "version": 187,
      "versionNonce": 871104169,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "单笔交易回报——基于技术分析的交易通常是短期交易。不要期望在\n短时间内获得巨额回报。运用技术分析的正确方法是寻找频繁出现的\n短期交易机会，这些机会可以为你带来虽小但稳定的利润。",
      "fontSize": 32.30302845348011,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "单笔交易回报——基于技术分析的交易通常是短期交易。不要期望在短时间内获得巨额回报。运用技术分析的正确方法是寻找频繁出现的短期交易机会，这些机会可以为你带来虽小但稳定的利润。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "aVPADNfo72gnSD0yPFPA1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1853.9395871843603,
      "y": 1632.5910801467785,
      "width": 993.3332519531251,
      "height": 80.75757113370028,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1173301437,
      "version": 184,
      "versionNonce": 1339513959,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "持仓周期——基于技术分析的交易可能持续几分钟到几周不等，通常\n不会超过这个时间。我们将在讨论时间框架时深入探讨这一方面。",
      "fontSize": 32.30302845348011,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "持仓周期——基于技术分析的交易可能持续几分钟到几周不等，通常不会超过这个时间。我们将在讨论时间框架时深入探讨这一方面。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "zy4hT-7V4XPJbHeFWu6za",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1851.6063504900244,
      "y": 1765.132413509088,
      "width": 1035.9999999999998,
      "height": 161.51514226740056,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpC",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 847416723,
      "version": 272,
      "versionNonce": 1093157257,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "风险——交易者通常出于某种原因进行交易；然而，如果股票价格出现不\n利波动，交易就会开始亏损。通常情况下，在这种情况下，交易者会继续\n持有亏损的仓位，希望能够挽回损失。记住，基于技术分析的交易是短期\n的；如果交易出现亏损，请务必及时止损，并寻找下一个机会。",
      "fontSize": 32.30302845348011,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "风险——交易者通常出于某种原因进行交易；然而，如果股票价格出现不利波动，交易就会开始亏损。通常情况下，在这种情况下，交易者会继续持有亏损的仓位，希望能够挽回损失。记住，基于技术分析的交易是短期的；如果交易出现亏损，请务必及时止损，并寻找下一个机会。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
