      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "技术分析与基本分析的对比",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "技术分析与基本分析的对比",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "VfqWH8xUOfU0NNjsrvHO6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3180.22545042492,
      "y": 270.8255041213258,
      "width": 1031.0946197509757,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 483217139,
      "version": 272,
      "versionNonce": 406498983,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "技术分析（TA）能够应用于多种资产，这或许是它相较于其他股\n票市场研究方法的最大优势之一",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "技术分析（TA）能够应用于多种资产，这或许是它相较于其他股票市场研究方法的最大优势之一",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "uYIVslViL_yNZ1QehWd3H",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3178.2727221534356,
      "y": 415.8255041213258,
      "width": 916.5599365234375,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1361503389,
      "version": 271,
      "versionNonce": 554316617,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "基本面分析(FA) 则面对不同的产品分析会随着变化而变化",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "基本面分析(FA) 则面对不同的产品分析会随着变化而变化",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "eBkzt50y61BiAhKxrrMBn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3255.272760300408,
      "y": 533.3255041213258,
      "width": 756,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 353516317,
      "version": 94,
      "versionNonce": 1918648775,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "无论研究何种资产，技术分析的概念都保持不变",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "无论研究何种资产，技术分析的概念都保持不变",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "AnwXd6xotZq3BVJH_gSEu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3119.2728213355645,
      "y": 647.658786592029,
      "width": 288,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 956913619,
      "version": 111,
      "versionNonce": 567730729,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "技术分析中的假设",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "技术分析中的假设",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "k4EK_1Pu6TM15vSr311nA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3241.9393557593926,
      "y": 736.9923132033571,
      "width": 822.3479614257812,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 203190099,
      "version": 119,
      "versionNonce": 891187431,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "技术分析唯一关注的是历史交易数据(价格和成交量)",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "技术分析唯一关注的是历史交易数据(价格和成交量)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "aCyzwqBi6Vmj3UIcybSGv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3236.6061038062676,
      "y": 833.6588171096071,
      "width": 612,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 697618323,
      "version": 142,
      "versionNonce": 116045065,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "关键的假设能确保有效的运用技术分析",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "关键的假设能确保有效的运用技术分析",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "X0vpj9MxjEfUYFMJJBZqV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3319.2727908179863,
      "y": 932.4921911330446,
      "width": 1026.6667480468743,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1001453245,
      "version": 140,
      "versionNonce": 973978631,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1） 市场会反映一切——这一假设告诉我们，所有公开的已知和\n未知信息都会反映在最新的股价中。例如，内部人士可能在预期\n公司即将发布利好的季度财报时大量买入股票。虽然内部人士的\n这种行为是秘密进行的，但股价会做出反应，从而向技术分析师\n揭示股价即将发生某些变化。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1） 市场会反映一切——这一假设告诉我们，所有公开的已知和未知信息都会反映在最新的股价中。例如，内部人士可能在预期公司即将发布利好的季度财报时大量买入股票。虽然内部人士的这种行为是秘密进行的，但股价会做出反应，从而向技术分析师揭示股价即将发生某些变化。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "sG-kROdFOpX58bqeKvm4i",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3311.2727908179863,
      "y": 1195.158817109607,
      "width": 1023.9999999999991,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1292672915,
      "version": 188,
      "versionNonce": 62991337,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2） “如何”比“为什么”更重要——这是第一个假设的延伸。沿用\n上面讨论的例子——只要技术分析师知道股价对内部人士买入股\n票行为的反应，他就不会去追问内部人士买入股票的原因。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2） “如何”比“为什么”更重要——这是第一个假设的延伸。沿用上面讨论的例子——只要技术分析师知道股价对内部人士买入股票行为的反应，他就不会去追问内部人士买入股票的原因。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "raH8moHS27EefqwQ5WkvU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3309.939416794549,
      "y": 1380.4921911330446,
      "width": 1039.9999999999993,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpN",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1329403677,
      "version": 220,
      "versionNonce": 1965466407,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3）价格走势与趋势一致——  市场中的所有重大波动都是趋势的\n结果。趋势的概念是技术分析的基础。例如，NIFTY 50 指数近\n期从 14750 点上涨至 18500 点并非一蹴而就，而是在 11 个月\n的时间里逐步实现的。换句话说，一旦趋势形成，价格就会沿着\n趋势的方向波动。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3）价格走势与趋势一致——  市场中的所有重大波动都是趋势的结果。趋势的概念是技术分析的基础。例如，NIFTY 50 指数近期从 14750 点上涨至 18500 点并非一蹴而就，而是在 11 个月的时间里逐步实现的。换句话说，一旦趋势形成，价格就会沿着趋势的方向波动。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "YnzAZPMVcsgdqTeZK-KWq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3311.6061343238457,
      "y": 1647.6588171096073,
      "width": 1047.9999999999993,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 538522931,
      "version": 203,
      "versionNonce": 1348847305,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4） 历史往往会重演——在技术分析中，价格趋势往往会重演。这\n是因为市场参与者每次对价格走势的反应都惊人地相似。例如，在\n上升趋势中，市场参与者会变得贪婪，不顾价格高位也想买入。同\n样，在下降趋势中，市场参与者会不顾价格低位和不具吸引力也想\n卖出。这种人类对股票价格的反应一直如一，从而确保了历史的重\n演",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4） 历史往往会重演——在技术分析中，价格趋势往往会重演。这是因为市场参与者每次对价格走势的反应都惊人地相似。例如，在上升趋势中，市场参与者会变得贪婪，不顾价格高位也想买入。同样，在下降趋势中，市场参与者会不顾价格低位和不具吸引力也想卖出。这种人类对股票价格的反应一直如一，从而确保了历史的重演",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "FYUORRL5Wq4aqFEi7vHjB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3123.0504412272735,
      "y": 1984.4919775099975,
      "width": 841,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1071890557,
      "version": 127,
      "versionNonce": 651535943,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "开盘价、最高价、最低价和收盘价来概括价格走势。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "开盘价、最高价、最低价和收盘价来概括价格走势。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "v2tyI9yWsDJ14VkX5IAw1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3282.3904776194854,
      "y": 2081.1586950392943,
      "width": 787.3199462890625,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpQ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1810142653,
      "version": 118,
      "versionNonce": 393479593,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "开盘价——当市场开盘交易时，第一笔交易执行的\n价格称为开盘价。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "开盘价——当市场开盘交易时，第一笔交易执行的价格称为开盘价。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "vMwckxTVz7FrsgY085pw3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3300.3904776194854,
      "y": 2258.6586950392943,
      "width": 751.3199462890625,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpR",
