      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "收盘价—— 这是最重要的价格，因为它是市场当\n天最终收盘的价格。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "收盘价—— 这是最重要的价格，因为它是市场当天最终收盘的价格。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "P4B5RCSse1-f2Mt4BbwRj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3206.717130146341,
      "y": 2616.992130097888,
      "width": 1095.3333587646484,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 953763763,
      "version": 163,
      "versionNonce": 1342926697,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "收盘价不仅反映了市场情绪，还能作为次日交易的参考点。因此，收\n盘价比开盘价、最高价或最低价更为重要。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "收盘价不仅反映了市场情绪，还能作为次日交易的参考点。因此，收盘价比开盘价、最高价或最低价更为重要。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
