    },
    {
      "id": "YDVuhuF7bZuqREeH5QvIz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6133.71718355212,
      "y": 136.2139878045948,
      "width": 556.7759399414062,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1914373555,
      "version": 115,
      "versionNonce": 1026883751,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "历史往往会重演------一个重要假设",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "历史往往会重演------一个重要假设",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "HbMNrVEtXBMT1LgaQaC6C",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6210.194554767941,
      "y": 260.3807053338917,
      "width": 773.7119750976562,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpm",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1283997907,
      "version": 150,
      "versionNonce": 487981385,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "假设今天，2014年7月7日，某只股票发生了一些\n事情。我们称这个因素为：",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "假设今天，2014年7月7日，某只股票发生了一些事情。我们称这个因素为：",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9jC4J0rQdhE7VkWtcaHNw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6291.383901081417,
      "y": 419.54727027529793,
      "width": 648,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpn",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1337403869,
      "version": 204,
      "versionNonce": 1748784071,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "因素一：该股票已连续四个交易日下跌。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "因素一：该股票已连续四个交易日下跌。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "plW0l0gjSyZTPFgMueuLc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6295.86790987048,
      "y": 495.3807053338917,
      "width": 769.031982421875,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpo",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 168734323,
      "version": 246,
      "versionNonce": 121172009,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "因素二——今天（2014年7月7日）是第五个交易\n日，股票成交量相对较低，但股价却下跌。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "因素二——今天（2014年7月7日）是第五个交易日，股票成交量相对较低，但股价却下跌。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "HhNEkMxvgeWJJJaxrS19M",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6296.537267170284,
      "y": 617.0472702752979,
      "width": 774.3599853515625,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpp",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1716512317,
      "version": 240,
      "versionNonce": 1496072935,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "因素 3 – 与过去四天相比，该股票今天的交易范\n围相当小。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "因素 3 – 与过去四天相比，该股票今天的交易范围相当小。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bChDj6x7uqT_PT8sO-Tdw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6201.259984455441,
      "y": 757.0474228631886,
      "width": 1228.248062133789,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpq",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 432348659,
      "version": 208,
      "versionNonce": 1356530441,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "时间流逝，假设几个月后，连续5个交易日观察到相同的因素。你认为第6个\n交易日会发生什么？",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "时间流逝，假设几个月后，连续5个交易日观察到相同的因素。你认为第6个交易日会发生什么？",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "orHGN1hLenHXDpIIFcwp3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6206.0504660228235,
      "y": 912.0474228631886,
      "width": 1205.3334350585938,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpr",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1524235581,
      "version": 142,
      "versionNonce": 9522695,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "据“历史往往会重演”这一假设，我们需要对这一假设进行补充。当过去某些\n因素在未来再次出现时，如果这些因素保持不变，我们预期会像过去一样出\n现相同的结果。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "据“历史往往会重演”这一假设，我们需要对这一假设进行补充。当过去某些因素在未来再次出现时，如果这些因素保持不变，我们预期会像过去一样出现相同的结果。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "KgnjFPglwIQRlEba4SOva",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6214.383824787472,
      "y": 1100.3808579217823,
      "width": 1027,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRps",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1438466323,
      "version": 184,
      "versionNonce": 108509673,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "因此，基于这一假设，我们可以预期，即使是这一次，股价在第\n6 个交易日也会上涨。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "因此，基于这一假设，我们可以预期，即使是这一次，股价在第 6 个交易日也会上涨。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Tyzbv3xERaCGfXrRMDp1w",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6153.349904499386,
      "y": 1239.5475754510792,
      "width": 308.4155445209601,
      "height": 46.66656494140625,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 423950749,
      "version": 106,
      "versionNonce": 157807911,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "K线形态及其预期",
      "fontSize": 37.333251953125,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "K线形态及其预期",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "rqMTMT4V45HNx1W-2fdg5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6276.495030842161,
      "y": 1308.158873058501,
      "width": 1163.1112467447922,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpu",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1421228467,
      "version": 92,
      "versionNonce": 421172425,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "K线图用于识别交易模式。反过来，这些模式又可以帮助技术分析师设置\n交易策略。模式是通过将两根或多根K线按特定顺序组合而成的。然而，\n有时仅凭一根K线就能识别出强有力的交易信号。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "K线图用于识别交易模式。反过来，这些模式又可以帮助技术分析师设置交易策略。模式是通过将两根或多根K线按特定顺序组合而成的。然而，有时仅凭一根K线就能识别出强有力的交易信号。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "DLzJAIEfc5v9sxx7oZXFz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6298.717270018593,
      "y": 1515.4366643996468,
      "width": 227.30398559570312,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpv",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1990839357,
      "version": 125,
      "versionNonce": 186431559,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.单个K线形态\n\n2.多K线形态\n\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.单个K线形态\n\n2.多K线形态\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "nQdFWYhF6qHoSjmDUM8r8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6172.050613524452,
      "y": 1694.7700384230843,
      "width": 346.0679931640625,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpw",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1402560691,
      "version": 111,
      "versionNonce": 1281299369,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "关于K线图的特殊假设",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "关于K线图的特殊假设",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "7lhXFxFqgDMQSvzXa00JF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6276.050583006874,
      "y": 1779.1032903762093,
      "width": 1394.6667480468748,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpx",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 165035379,
      "version": 138,
      "versionNonce": 2072778599,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "学习各种形态之前，还有一些假设需要牢记。这些假设仅适用于K线图。请务必仔细阅读\n这些假设，因为我们稍后会频繁地用到它们。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "学习各种形态之前，还有一些假设需要牢记。这些假设仅适用于K线图。请务必仔细阅读这些假设，因为我们稍后会频繁地用到它们。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "qIRIhrJtMPNRc99zQAhiy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6397.606247069374,
      "y": 1937.7700384230843,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpy",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1217261683,
      "version": 92,
      "versionNonce": 1685108361,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "逢高买入，逢低卖出——强势用阳线（蓝色）表\n示，疲软用阴线（红色）表示。因此，买入时务必\n选择蓝色K线日，卖出时务必选择红色K线日。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "逢高买入，逢低卖出——强势用阳线（蓝色）表示，疲软用阴线（红色）表示。因此，买入时务必选择蓝色K线日，卖出时务必选择红色K线日。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "JxYTf2CdHxfVrk8xFJPKl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6399.606186034218,
      "y": 2119.103412446522,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRpz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1138607165,
      "version": 163,
      "versionNonce": 1627558535,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "灵活运用模式（量化并验证） ——虽然教科书对\n模式的定义可能列出某些标准，但由于市场状况的\n变化，模式可能会略有不同。因此，我们需要保持\n一定的灵活性。然而，这种灵活性必须有所限制，\n因此始终需要对这种灵活性进行量化。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "灵活运用模式（量化并验证） ——虽然教科书对模式的定义可能列出某些标准，但由于市场状况的变化，模式可能会略有不同。因此，我们需要保持一定的灵活性。然而，这种灵活性必须有所限制，因此始终需要对这种灵活性进行量化。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ckwWY3RGSn_pH2OFrCXPy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6392.272903563515,
      "y": 2391.1035650344124,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRq0",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1157458451,
      "version": 117,
      "versionNonce": 336264553,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "寻找先前的趋势——如果你在寻找看涨形态，那么\n先前的趋势应该是看跌的；同样地，如果你在寻找\n看跌形态，那么先前的趋势应该是看涨的。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "寻找先前的趋势——如果你在寻找看涨形态，那么先前的趋势应该是看跌的；同样地，如果你在寻找看跌形态，那么先前的趋势应该是看涨的。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "nK_CkB5TynRKOt4EISrKi",
