    {
      "id": "XUYHY9TJIfmFXJ8kf3K-T",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7782.258051795714,
      "y": 97.35447540963969,
      "width": 845.0278930664062,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRq2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 761222835,
      "version": 223,
      "versionNonce": 712599625,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "看涨秃头秃脚(K线为绿色)/看跌秃头秃脚(K线为红色)\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "看涨秃头秃脚(K线为绿色)/看跌秃头秃脚(K线为红色)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "XIdtpUlJjkeQVA9hAQnUj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7799.757759335591,
      "y": 1021.8545033840869,
      "width": 1347.8399658203125,
      "height": 405,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRq3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 763048339,
      "version": 1130,
      "versionNonce": 1650908359,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n\n露出的可控范围为\n\n           实体  = |开盘价 - 收盘价|\n\n           影线  =  上影线长度 /  下影线长队 最大值\n\n           影线长度 / 实体  x 100%     <= 0.2%(及其严苛 ，可以放大到 3%左右)",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n\n露出的可控范围为\n\n           实体  = |开盘价 - 收盘价|\n\n           影线  =  上影线长度 /  下影线长队 最大值\n\n           影线长度 / 实体  x 100%     <= 0.2%(及其严苛 ，可以放大到 3%左右)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "8w0UHGKgfD5GwPIzguxFl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7788.924476864888,
      "y": 1505.1878621487353,
      "width": 850.1759033203125,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRq4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 20353661,
      "version": 944,
      "versionNonce": 26703657,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如果 上下都有影线露出那不是这个形态 \n \n看涨 ： 下影线几乎< = 0.2% ~ 3%， 上影线为0 \n\n看跌  :  下影线 0  ,  上影线几乎为< = 0.2% ~ 3% ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如果 上下都有影线露出那不是这个形态 \n \n看涨 ： 下影线几乎< = 0.2% ~ 3%， 上影线为0 \n\n看跌  :  下影线 0  ,  上影线几乎为< = 0.2% ~ 3% ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "H8QWYwRsIRWXwbeU8_Ey4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7904.2495445978075,
      "y": 1813.5951654343382,
      "width": 1423.8006591796875,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRq5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1953330127,
      "version": 1173,
      "versionNonce": 522038247,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "两者交易者：风险偏好型，风险厌恶型\n\n风险偏好型:  会在看涨秃头出现后即将闭盘的时候买入，检查市场价格 ？= 当日最高价\n                                                                    当日开盘价 ？= 当日最低价\n\n                    遵循了强势买入，弱势卖出\n                            灵活运用",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "两者交易者：风险偏好型，风险厌恶型\n\n风险偏好型:  会在看涨秃头出现后即将闭盘的时候买入，检查市场价格 ？= 当日最高价\n                                                                    当日开盘价 ？= 当日最低价\n\n                    遵循了强势买入，弱势卖出\n                            灵活运用",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "EU2b9_UhDZTHLJHnSVm2N",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8879.249620891753,
      "y": 2007.5950637090777,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRq6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2088172193,
      "version": 642,
      "versionNonce": 735095305,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "教课书级别的不会有，但是看涨的下影线可以有一个比例",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "教课书级别的不会有，但是看涨的下影线可以有一个比例",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "pfodomqLJJv80IsUMBUqL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7895.083189464751,
      "y": 2176.7619338262652,
      "width": 1977.156005859375,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRq7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2067155009,
      "version": 812,
      "versionNonce": 913151751,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "风险厌恶者: 会在形态形成的第二天收盘买入，在买入之前交易会确认今天是不是强势,但是缺点是买入价格略高，止损比较深",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "风险厌恶者: 会在形态形成的第二天收盘买入，在买入之前交易会确认今天是不是强势,但是缺点是买入价格略高，止损比较深",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "V7tQx5qOQWMylQpu_FUCN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8243.4165482294,
      "y": 2288.4284987676715,
      "width": 432,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRq8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1529888399,
      "version": 574,
      "versionNonce": 1646297321,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "遵循了强势买入，弱势卖出",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "遵循了强势买入，弱势卖出",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C5tTPnV2cZcRZ4xT9TDsV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7795.143442910816,
      "y": 2431.2688024611703,
      "width": 892.260009765625,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRq9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1794012031,
      "version": 600,
      "versionNonce": 785587751,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "看涨秃头秃脚::如果没有按照预想的来,跌了如何设置止损",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "看涨秃头秃脚::如果没有按照预想的来,跌了如何设置止损",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "kF1aPqvTLJR4B4vJALLPc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8763.143400949146,
      "y": 1594.6023138137093,
      "width": 963.8277587890625,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRqA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1165823441,
      "version": 587,
      "versionNonce": 840072137,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "其实应该::不管是看涨还是看跌\n影线可以不考虑位置，只考虑 一侧是否几乎为0\n                                  一侧影线是否< = 0.2% - 3%",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "其实应该::不管是看涨还是看跌\n影线可以不考虑位置，只考虑 一侧是否几乎为0\n                                  一侧影线是否< = 0.2% - 3%",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "XH3lMBXpaHUB6hLhbpIJN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7791.2249668060795,
      "y": 997.9356344313851,
      "width": 1122.1706085205085,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
