    },
    {
      "id": "KDLkt7Y6gzHWQF9i8L-iD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10289.421285750377,
      "y": 1624.4359675816136,
      "width": 1178.6667480468748,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRqi",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 943210449,
      "version": 216,
      "versionNonce": 929245353,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如果忽略上影线，只考虑实体和下影线，你认为发生了什么？这与多头的\n情况非常相似。下影线的存在表明空头确实试图压低市场，但他们的努力\n并未真正成功。如果空头真的成功了，那么实体应该是一根长长的红色K\n线，而不是一根短K线。因此，空头试图压低市场的行为可以被视为一次尝\n试，但他们并没有真正成功。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如果忽略上影线，只考虑实体和下影线，你认为发生了什么？这与多头的情况非常相似。下影线的存在表明空头确实试图压低市场，但他们的努力并未真正成功。如果空头真的成功了，那么实体应该是一根长长的红色K线，而不是一根短K线。因此，空头试图压低市场的行为可以被视为一次尝试，但他们并没有真正成功。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "F5ZJ1odNCGRW2L7CfKRCn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10191.08789646815,
      "y": 1959.2696467808323,
      "width": 992.0000000000002,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRqj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 750281919,
      "version": 201,
      "versionNonce": 1111478887,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "它仅仅表明多空双方都无法左右市场走向，市场显得犹豫不决",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "它仅仅表明多空双方都无法左右市场走向，市场显得犹豫不决",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "n0zuiWSAcduvhaL6WEQ0Y",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10124.42122471522,
      "y": 2153.1027156284886,
      "width": 324,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRqk",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2119449841,
      "version": 160,
      "versionNonce": 1613376393,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "下跌趋势中的纺垂线",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "下跌趋势中的纺垂线",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "v2_MysaKA6kHOhkZ0wNrW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10247.754629256237,
      "y": 2227.2694636753636,
      "width": 1268,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRql",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 14623953,
      "version": 126,
      "versionNonce": 797371783,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "在下跌趋势中，空头占据绝对优势，他们成功地将价格压低。在下跌趋势中出现\n纺锤线形态，可能意味着空头正在巩固阵地，准备开启新一轮抛售。多头也试图\n阻止价格下跌，并努力守住阵地，但未能成功。毕竟，如果他们成功了，当天应\n该出现一根漂亮的蓝色K线，而不是纺锤线形态。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "在下跌趋势中，空头占据绝对优势，他们成功地将价格压低。在下跌趋势中出现纺锤线形态，可能意味着空头正在巩固阵地，准备开启新一轮抛售。多头也试图阻止价格下跌，并努力守住阵地，但未能成功。毕竟，如果他们成功了，当天应该出现一根漂亮的蓝色K线，而不是纺锤线形态。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "QOOg_LlOoghDOdQs1oqpS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10283.754507185924,
      "y": 2453.1027156284886,
