      "seed": 1249428543,
      "version": 221,
      "versionNonce": 394110119,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如何交易 如果交易者想买500股，可以先如买入250股，静观其变\n           上涨 追加股票  下跌 即时止损",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
