    },
    {
      "id": "5htITJrXwUT2_WrMYA5Iw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10285.087881209362,
      "y": 2911.936089651926,
      "width": 1076,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRqp",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1537610623,
      "version": 295,
      "versionNonce": 969963463,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "多头已不再占据主导地位；如果多头仍然占据主导地位，图表上就\n不会形成纺锤线了。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "多头已不再占据主导地位；如果多头仍然占据主导地位，图表上就不会形成纺锤线了。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "wwSbBfneSbXJ0rArrOKny",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10286.421255232799,
      "y": 3018.6027156284886,
      "width": 1073.3333740234368,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRqq",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 672540657,
      "version": 171,
      "versionNonce": 1667828777,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "随着陀螺形态的形成，空头已进入市场。尽管并未成功，但重点在\n于多头给了空头回旋的空间。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "随着陀螺形态的形成，空头已进入市场。尽管并未成功，但重点在于多头给了空头回旋的空间。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "sXNN2bd0R6e2mHtyO3O3z",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10297.403204085338,
      "y": 3159.4361506870823,
      "width": 486.0359802246094,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRqr",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 182218015,
      "version": 242,
      "versionNonce": 748414695,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "两种情况 1. 会有新一轮的下跌\n\n           2.可能逆转,上涨",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "两种情况 1. 会有新一轮的下跌\n\n           2.可能逆转,上涨",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "M0RFOVa_nAtetqvUwz23x",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10304.421194197643,
      "y": 3373.1027156284886,
      "width": 978.6599731445312,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRqs",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 889695295,
      "version": 213,
      "versionNonce": 1755815689,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如何交易：如果交易中有500股,可以先做空250股，静观其变\n             下跌追加, 上涨止损",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如何交易：如果交易中有500股,可以先做空250股，静观其变\n             下跌追加, 上涨止损",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S4Z1cc49aSUvhIxigWDNw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10235.310171248424,
      "y": 3516.547336396718,
      "width": 1285.3333333333326,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRqt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1774740017,
      "version": 196,
      "versionNonce": 241988103,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "总而言之，纺锤线形态表明市场存在混乱和犹豫不决的情绪，反转和延续的可能\n性均等。在形势明朗之前，交易者应保持谨慎，并尽可能缩小仓位。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "总而言之，纺锤线形态表明市场存在混乱和犹豫不决的情绪，反转和延续的可能性均等。在形势明朗之前，交易者应保持谨慎，并尽可能缩小仓位。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Gwvkrm1-EthRDQ7a_sY-X",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10080.198962650606,
      "y": 3693.7693721226296,
      "width": 108,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRqu",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 340627455,
      "version": 33,
      "versionNonce": 844158441,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "十字星",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "十字星",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "AiK-FASA0vfv4DT0cxFSM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10199.198962650606,
      "y": 3781.2693721226296,
      "width": 1442.0000762939462,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRqv",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1056182943,
      "version": 213,
      "versionNonce": 2017368359,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "十字星的经典定义是：开盘价等于收盘价，实体部分几乎没有。上下影线的长度可以任意。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "十字星的经典定义是：开盘价等于收盘价，实体部分几乎没有。上下影线的长度可以任意。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "GuMbbRL1qFa8rDhgqtJ1q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10143.745723209688,
      "y": 3861.2695247105203,
      "width": 1647.9066314697259,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRqw",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 574744415,
      "version": 166,
      "versionNonce": 594555081,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "要记住第二条规则，即“灵活变通，验证和量化”，即使实体非常薄，该蜡烛也可以被视为十字星。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "要记住第二条规则，即“灵活变通，验证和量化”，即使实体非常薄，该蜡烛也可以被视为十字星。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Alh_aTpZ01ql87rw-WgGc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10210.568370304414,
      "y": 3951.2693721226296,
      "width": 1444.2612609863277,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRqx",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1945874911,
      "version": 151,
      "versionNonce": 796843079,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "对于实体极薄的蜡烛图来说，蜡烛的颜色并不重要。重要的是开盘价和收盘价非常接近",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "对于实体极薄的蜡烛图来说，蜡烛的颜色并不重要。重要的是开盘价和收盘价非常接近",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "AWe_QTZidXlg_8Bm1B3Li",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10360.865603885957,
      "y": 4057.936013357981,
      "width": 963.6667175292969,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRqy",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 964475199,
      "version": 80,
      "versionNonce": 832647081,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "十字星和纺锤线形态经常成群出现，表明市场犹豫不决。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "十字星和纺锤线形态经常成群出现，表明市场犹豫不决。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "XGB88Fo1USEo70fTHdTdv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10330.198962650606,
      "y": 4305.4360896519265,
      "width": 995.6519165039062,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRqz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 727853919,
      "version": 432,
      "versionNonce": 403290983,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "纺锤线和十字星关于实体，影线：\n\n                     实体没有固定的数值，一般来说,越接近越好\n             \n                     影线不重要,重要的是 开盘价和收盘价相近\n\n                     影线长度可以不相等，颜色也不重要",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "纺锤线和十字星关于实体，影线：\n\n                     实体没有固定的数值，一般来说,越接近越好\n             \n                     影线不重要,重要的是 开盘价和收盘价相近\n\n                     影线长度可以不相等，颜色也不重要",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
