      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "锤子线形态的前期趋势应该是下降趋势",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "锤子线形态的前期趋势应该是下降趋势",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "fbHLjQFK2n48uNY5NR4J_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12269.680539570207,
      "y": 1678.4553496345652,
      "width": 684,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRrD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 166545809,
      "version": 128,
      "versionNonce": 1345905991,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "市场处于下跌趋势，空头完全掌控了市场。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "市场处于下跌趋势，空头完全掌控了市场。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9crhCAoirPqn_T3PuCEqO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12273.013852558488,
      "y": 1735.1218535408152,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRrE",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1301451775,
      "version": 130,
      "versionNonce": 405288617,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "在下跌趋势中，市场每天开盘价都会低于前一日收\n盘价，并且收盘价也会低于前一日收盘价，从而形\n成新的低点。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "在下跌趋势中，市场每天开盘价都会低于前一日收盘价，并且收盘价也会低于前一日收盘价，从而形成新的低点。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "kDSDGb1FwunCGwLGM0Tq3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12269.013852558488,
      "y": 1870.6219756111277,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRrF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2039476081,
      "version": 119,
      "versionNonce": 110797927,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "锤子线形态形成当天，市场如预期般走低，并创下\n新低。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "锤子线形态形成当天，市场如预期般走低，并创下新低。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "pbOXfsiVWhQHwVFZ7cpFU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12275.680539570207,
      "y": 1977.2886015876902,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRrG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 457030687,
      "version": 106,
      "versionNonce": 1092450697,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "然而，在低点，出现了一些买盘兴趣，这推动价格\n走高，以至于股票收盘价接近当日最高点。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "然而，在低点，出现了一些买盘兴趣，这推动价格走高，以至于股票收盘价接近当日最高点。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9sqQf3mDx8SFHDFHqEO06",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12270.34716554677,
      "y": 2089.28860158769,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRrH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 228776273,
      "version": 141,
      "versionNonce": 79134599,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "锤子线形态当日的价格走势表明，多头试图阻止价\n格进一步下跌，并且取得了相当大的成功。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "锤子线形态当日的价格走势表明，多头试图阻止价格进一步下跌，并且取得了相当大的成功。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "QIsDdejWbYUEucNPVEcZ5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12272.347226581925,
      "y": 2214.6219756111277,
      "width": 756,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRrI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 898555967,
      "version": 118,
      "versionNonce": 1680302185,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "多头的这一举动有可能改变股票的市场情绪。因\n此，投资者应该寻找买入机会。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "多头的这一举动有可能改变股票的市场情绪。因此，投资者应该寻找买入机会。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "XEFIWVjLa-3ZFCG8sQjhO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12078.347135029191,
      "y": 2342.4552275642527,
      "width": 180,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRrJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1828125073,
      "version": 42,
      "versionNonce": 1556870823,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "交易设置：",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "交易设置：",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "zT2OGrHn6K-ZhpM-Rgiyk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12208.347135029191,
      "y": 2432.4552275642527,
      "width": 1138.06787109375,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRrK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 38938193,
      "version": 746,
      "versionNonce": 521235273,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.锤子线暗示做多\n2.锤子形态中颜色不重要，这个并不违法规则1\n   如果是风险厌恶者，要确定第二天收盘后为涨在买入\n3.形态的辨别: a) 开盘价 = 收盘价(误差控制在1 -2 %)\n                 b) 上影线几乎没有(deepseek::   上影线长度 < 实体/3)\n                  c) 实体 相对于整根k线 来说相对较小\n                   d) 下影线 >  2x实体",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.锤子线暗示做多\n2.锤子形态中颜色不重要，这个并不违法规则1\n   如果是风险厌恶者，要确定第二天收盘后为涨在买入\n3.形态的辨别: a) 开盘价 = 收盘价(误差控制在1 -2 %)\n                 b) 上影线几乎没有(deepseek::   上影线长度 < 实体/3)\n                  c) 实体 相对于整根k线 来说相对较小\n                   d) 下影线 >  2x实体",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "eiki_lA9q0lZknxK8am5z",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12223.013944111222,
      "y": 2909.455288599409,
      "width": 1120.0000000000005,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRrL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1746147793,
      "version": 226,
      "versionNonce": 629443015,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "一旦您开始交易，就必须持有该仓位，直到达到止损位或目标价位为\n止。在达到止损位或目标价位之前，请不要调整交易策略",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "一旦您开始交易，就必须持有该仓位，直到达到止损位或目标价位为止。在达到止损位或目标价位之前，请不要调整交易策略",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
