      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "吊颈型",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "吊颈型",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "3T8oosT8xYneg2LGREEqQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12161.68081422841,
      "y": 3226.4551665290965,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRrO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 802829329,
      "version": 186,
      "versionNonce": 646180105,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如果在趋势的顶部出现纸伞状形态，则称为吊颈线",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如果在趋势的顶部出现纸伞状形态，则称为吊颈线",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "7c-5cMM2ROZenTbbt-ftN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12163.014188251847,
      "y": 3315.9551665290965,
      "width": 1124.0000610351558,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRrP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1610828881,
      "version": 233,
      "versionNonce": 1707344903,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "只有当吊颈线出现之前是上升趋势时，它才能被归类为吊颈线",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "只有当吊颈线出现之前是上升趋势时，它才能被归类为吊颈线",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "_aSwd3U-kJBx3XlPFy6bn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12294.347440204972,
      "y": 3410.4551665290965,
      "width": 756,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRrQ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1983833265,
      "version": 210,
      "versionNonce": 1265853417,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "市场处于上升趋势，因此多头完全掌控了市场。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "市场处于上升趋势，因此多头完全掌控了市场。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C36PVlTCMmEhQ-VT3OT6N",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12293.68081422841,
      "y": 3465.4551665290965,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRrR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1024703199,
      "version": 224,
      "versionNonce": 1658055463,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "市场呈现出不断创出新高和更高低点的趋势。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "市场呈现出不断创出新高和更高低点的趋势。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "G_ko1lo39LFzRoRON68PK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12297.227445087785,
      "y": 3520.4551665290965,
      "width": 750.239990234375,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRrS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 457254545,
      "version": 210,
      "versionNonce": 1427177161,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "当出现“吊人”图案时，熊市就成功进入了市场。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "当出现“吊人”图案时，熊市就成功进入了市场。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ll9n1iL-D4VJFhRQw6uuG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12293.680753193254,
      "y": 3576.788540552534,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRrT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 297207551,
      "version": 224,
      "versionNonce": 2140794439,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "这一点从吊死者的长长的下阴影中可以得到强调。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "这一点从吊死者的长长的下阴影中可以得到强调。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "E0IDepT0gDtXdh6wkMzbC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12295.014066181535,
      "y": 3634.4551665290965,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRrU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1314925681,
      "version": 225,
      "versionNonce": 1375223209,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "熊市的出现表明它们正试图打破牛市的统治地位。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "熊市的出现表明它们正试图打破牛市的统治地位。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "y5N_74_iSpVq2mOQsH12M",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12217.680753193254,
      "y": 2782.4551665290965,
      "width": 642.9240112304688,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
