      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4.教科书定义为：没有下影线 ::较短的下影线是可以接受的(< 实体/3)",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4.教科书定义为：没有下影线 ::较短的下影线是可以接受的(< 实体/3)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "nt6qqIfzXX3gSXX7sn5uq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12157.013832213426,
      "y": 4899.5664844815665,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRrf",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 108197937,
      "version": 48,
      "versionNonce": 1426738439,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "之前的趋势应该是上涨",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "之前的趋势应该是上涨",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "TuCd5TRGJZJRWDkt3UGwj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12037.013832213426,
      "y": 5009.5664844815665,
      "width": 72,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRrg",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 179127825,
      "version": 44,
      "versionNonce": 290597609,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "原理",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "原理",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Hxu4le7WC-A8DI_FzPd1V",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12161.013870360399,
      "y": 5077.89991954016,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRrh",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 230933009,
      "version": 56,
      "versionNonce": 73995303,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "该股票处于上升趋势，这意味着多头完全掌控了市\n场。当多头占据主导地位时，股票或市场往往会创\n出新高和更高低点。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "该股票处于上升趋势，这意味着多头完全掌控了市场。当多头占据主导地位时，股票或市场往往会创出新高和更高低点。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "v0j7-RIJX6wOLZoBMleOz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12161.013870360399,
      "y": 5245.39991954016,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRri",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1927144319,
      "version": 56,
      "versionNonce": 561964489,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "当流星形态出现时，市场如预期般走高，并创下新\n高。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "当流星形态出现时，市场如预期般走高，并创下新高。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bkpwkt01W7bCTUWacxb1O",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12161.013870360399,
      "y": 5345.39991954016,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRrj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 486758385,
      "version": 56,
      "versionNonce": 1721890631,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "然而，在当日最高点，会出现抛售压力，股价回落\n至接近当日最低点收盘，从而形成流星线形态。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "然而，在当日最高点，会出现抛售压力，股价回落至接近当日最低点收盘，从而形成流星线形态。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "-pjAX3yjuxoQJ9ItyyqQY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12161.013870360399,
      "y": 5445.39991954016,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRrk",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 695409567,
      "version": 56,
      "versionNonce": 1175536809,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "抛售表明空头已经入场，而且他们确实成功地压低\n了价格。这一点从较长的上影线即可看出。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "抛售表明空头已经入场，而且他们确实成功地压低了价格。这一点从较长的上影线即可看出。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0GvMJYkJZoZz9G8jcdVYK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12179.013870360399,
      "y": 5545.39991954016,
      "width": 756,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRrl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 798306769,
      "version": 56,
      "versionNonce": 1376876135,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "预计空头将在接下来的几个交易日继续抛售。因\n此，交易者应寻找做空机会。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "预计空头将在接下来的几个交易日继续抛售。因此，交易者应寻找做空机会。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Q__c4f0xT8aerWSNsiLVq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12142.013832213426,
      "y": 5707.0664844815665,
      "width": 1007.7119750976562,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRrm",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 692171391,
      "version": 143,
      "versionNonce": 716490633,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5.厌恶交易者,应等待第二天收盘前确定为红色(跌)，在入场做空",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5.厌恶交易者,应等待第二天收盘前确定为红色(跌)，在入场做空",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "IpXezNzFm1vEcOeeJUGmP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12137.013832213426,
      "y": 5819.5664844815665,
      "width": 356.90399169921875,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
