      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "吞没形态(1)",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "吞没形态(1)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "VCoWbvuiZA_8SM8yixLiJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13630.955469040637,
      "y": 215.65097990490062,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRrr",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2122005979,
      "version": 221,
      "versionNonce": 500472775,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "吞没形态需要两个交易日才能形成",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "吞没形态需要两个交易日才能形成",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ZwWJjIGoUaCwGl-srW3-t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13629.92141142345,
      "y": 322.4843539283381,
      "width": 996.7346191406259,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRrs",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1983605851,
      "version": 153,
      "versionNonce": 1277765673,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "典型的吞没形态中，第一天会出现一根较短的K线，\n第二天会出现一根相对较长的K线",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "典型的吞没形态中，第一天会出现一根较短的K线，\n第二天会出现一根相对较长的K线",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "7EKHqvG3XuVfHWHfubxii",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13630.206048874621,
      "y": 479.8176669166194,
      "width": 974.8319702148444,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRrt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 96682197,
      "version": 147,
      "versionNonce": 1148947175,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如果吞没形态出现在趋势的底部，则称为“看涨吞没”形态",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如果吞没形态出现在趋势的底部，则称为“看涨吞没”形态",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "__KLTr_ZuGPYnh1znzN6Z",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13630.206109909777,
      "y": 593.1509188697444,
      "width": 1009.4987182617188,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRru",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 531150363,
      "version": 101,
      "versionNonce": 2063874825,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如果吞没形态出现在趋势的顶部，则称为“看跌吞没”形态",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如果吞没形态出现在趋势的顶部，则称为“看跌吞没”形态",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
