      "text": "原理：",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "原理：",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "OlwDwWHB3mIg_dpRtJi6X",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13874.399830409451,
      "y": 1465.3176007952002,
      "width": 576,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRs1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 17138427,
      "version": 230,
      "versionNonce": 1089953639,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "市场处于下行趋势，价格持续下跌。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "市场处于下行趋势，价格持续下跌。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "3qSknfDMQi-IdpaNclHMj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13873.483143397732,
      "y": 1547.1509748186377,
      "width": 796.5,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRs2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 507805237,
      "version": 252,
      "versionNonce": 1950215817,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "在该形态的第一天（P1），市场低开并创下新低。\n这在此过程中形成了一根红色蜡烛线。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "在该形态的第一天（P1），市场低开并创下新低。这在此过程中形成了一根红色蜡烛线。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Uq1VQAh2gEsuYrrZxrczm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13874.399830409451,
      "y": 1667.4842267717627,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRs3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 888236955,
      "version": 222,
      "versionNonce": 1774508679,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "在该形态的第二天（P2），股票开盘价接近P1的\n收盘价，并试图创出新低。然而，在当日低点附近\n突然出现买盘，推动股价收于高于前一日开盘价的\n位置。这种价格走势形成了一根蓝色K线。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "在该形态的第二天（P2），股票开盘价接近P1的收盘价，并试图创出新低。然而，在当日低点附近突然出现买盘，推动股价收于高于前一日开盘价的位置。这种价格走势形成了一根蓝色K线。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "R5g8xuwzGKBa-EeUQRR9-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13881.235767909451,
      "y": 1897.3176007952002,
      "width": 770.3280029296875,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRs4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1575022485,
      "version": 212,
      "versionNonce": 628176233,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "P2的价格走势也表明，多头突然发起了一次强劲\n的尝试，试图打破下跌趋势，并且相当成功。P2\n上的长蓝色蜡烛图就证明了这一点。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "P2的价格走势也表明，多头突然发起了一次强劲的尝试，试图打破下跌趋势，并且相当成功。P2上的长蓝色蜡烛图就证明了这一点。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "wVGOglnSPIDk5MWWgz4Al",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13885.235767909451,
      "y": 2076.8176007952,
      "width": 770.3280029296875,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRs5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 546783291,
      "version": 210,
      "versionNonce": 225833383,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "熊市并未预料到牛市在P2区域的突然行动，因此\n牛市的举动让熊市有些慌乱，使它们感到紧张。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "熊市并未预料到牛市在P2区域的突然行动，因此牛市的举动让熊市有些慌乱，使它们感到紧张。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Aq8BTFCby_yXdf5rXmtqP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13889.066456386014,
      "y": 2204.8174787248877,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRs6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1202205941,
      "version": 216,
      "versionNonce": 576233545,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "预计未来几个交易日，看涨情绪将持续，价格将进\n一步走高，因此交易者应寻找买入机会。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "预计未来几个交易日，看涨情绪将持续，价格将进一步走高，因此交易者应寻找买入机会。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9J1B4xuzf2WpH9YlREMY_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13738.177436101998,
      "y": 2379.6506289527524,
      "width": 239.90396118164062,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRs7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1734932219,
      "version": 45,
      "versionNonce": 1161241799,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "交易设置:      ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "交易设置:      ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "EJDaiBjK2itknydAalEOX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13957.844153631295,
      "y": 2382.984064011346,
      "width": 529.2359619140625,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRs8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2050693333,
      "version": 136,
      "versionNonce": 684699433,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.看涨吞没形态的演变历时两天。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.看涨吞没形态的演变历时两天。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "BFPCkiHaxl0OahzFlx8vR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13957.430075872506,
      "y": 2480.4839114234555,
      "width": 973.1612854003909,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRs9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 419666139,
      "version": 150,
      "versionNonce": 1352987623,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2.风险承担者在确认P2完全包含P1后，自行发起对P2的交易",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2.风险承担者在确认P2完全包含P1后，自行发起对P2的交易",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Mj284DYUrwAEl4EGCtoyB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13954.143515813912,
      "y": 2574.650781540643,
      "width": 1726.4012756347663,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRsA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 241909627,
      "version": 221,
      "versionNonce": 792846857,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3.风险厌恶型交易者会在确认当日形成蓝色K线后，于第二天（即P2之后的第二天）在收盘价附近开始交易。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3.风险厌恶型交易者会在确认当日形成蓝色K线后，于第二天（即P2之后的第二天）在收盘价附近开始交易。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "OO_PtUafo0-XesNPremLv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13954.010794866646,
      "y": 2667.9839114234555,
      "width": 999.7919921875,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRsB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1337674747,
      "version": 160,
      "versionNonce": 1204543239,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4.若第二天是红色蜡烛,风险厌恶型应该忽略这笔交易, 强买低买",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4.若第二天是红色蜡烛,风险厌恶型应该忽略这笔交易, 强买低买",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "fy8YC_JBdO3qvSUlvTygj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13956.510794866646,
      "y": 2754.6506289527524,
      "width": 762.3359375,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
