      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRsM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1309665371,
      "version": 267,
      "versionNonce": 1542260553,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "原理:",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "原理:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "GbuFEL2S4GdFsnSfGp_YS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13901.17747424897,
      "y": 4554.650628952752,
      "width": 684,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRsN",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2133980341,
      "version": 398,
      "versionNonce": 1791012295,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "首先，多头完全掌控了市场，推高了价格。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "首先，多头完全掌控了市场，推高了价格。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5a2O6ECtXkzryKr6U8j-D",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13904.860839117135,
      "y": 4650.4839114234555,
      "width": 753.2999877929688,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRsO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1016896795,
      "version": 324,
      "versionNonce": 557790761,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "在 P1 上，正如预期的那样，市场上涨并创下新\n高，再次确认了市场的上涨趋势。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "在 P1 上，正如预期的那样，市场上涨并创下新高，再次确认了市场的上涨趋势。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "LWIB3ITep6SmOTIi3Gjdg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13907.17747424897,
      "y": 4796.317193894159,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRsP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1591449109,
      "version": 304,
      "versionNonce": 2115329255,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如预期，P2阶段市场高开并试图创出新高。然\n而，在高位附近，抛售压力开始出现。这种抛售来\n得猝不及防，因此往往会削弱多头的力量。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如预期，P2阶段市场高开并试图创出新高。然而，在高位附近，抛售压力开始出现。这种抛售来得猝不及防，因此往往会削弱多头的力量。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "EPmYZarsBgQ64GjNcSLee",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13913.844191778267,
      "y": 4987.150628952752,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRsQ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1054884283,
      "version": 307,
      "versionNonce": 505973001,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "卖方将价格压低，以至于股票收盘价低于前一日开\n盘价（P1）。这令多头感到不安。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "卖方将价格压低，以至于股票收盘价低于前一日开盘价（P1）。这令多头感到不安。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dT2ZEaFD0VAKv5eXf7CCO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13922.17747424897,
      "y": 5137.150628952752,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRsR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1334446965,
      "version": 316,
      "versionNonce": 491202567,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "P2 的强劲抛售表明空头可能已经成功突破了多头\n的堡垒，未来几天市场可能会继续面临抛售压力。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "P2 的强劲抛售表明空头可能已经成功突破了多头的堡垒，未来几天市场可能会继续面临抛售压力。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "RXpTkqKuaybx9JvQ8oT8m",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13927.17747424897,
      "y": 5285.4839114234555,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRsS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1317425755,
      "version": 302,
      "versionNonce": 472154089,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "其思路是做空指数或股票，以从预期的价格下跌中\n获利。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "其思路是做空指数或股票，以从预期的价格下跌中获利。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
