    {
      "id": "sTAdwSphSX8tO-ATqWXGr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13775.510833013619,
      "y": 5439.650476364862,
      "width": 1047.347900390625,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRsU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 597126229,
      "version": 625,
      "versionNonce": 691968713,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "交易设置 :   1.看跌吞没 提示做空\n\n               2.  P2 开盘价 >  P1收盘价\n                    P2  收盘价  <  P1 开盘价\n                \n               风险承担着即可交易\n               \n               3.风险厌恶者需要 等P2的下根K线为 红色 开始交易\n         \n               4.止损 设置在  P1 P2之间的最高点",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "交易设置 :   1.看跌吞没 提示做空\n\n               2.  P2 开盘价 >  P1收盘价\n                    P2  收盘价  <  P1 开盘价\n                \n               风险承担着即可交易\n               \n               3.风险厌恶者需要 等P2的下根K线为 红色 开始交易\n         \n               4.止损 设置在  P1 P2之间的最高点",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
