      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "原理",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "原理",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Weqb1moyatQruQaTSQ3Ji",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17741.90361035062,
      "y": 1247.677788870678,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRt7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1327130818,
      "version": 233,
      "versionNonce": 2059048359,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "市场处于下跌趋势，价格持续走低，空头完全掌控\n了市场。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "市场处于下跌趋势，价格持续走低，空头完全掌控了市场。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "wBIq4Sg6eHl-IlxvlxGpY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17746.32023632718,
      "y": 1394.3444148472404,
      "width": 796.5,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRt8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 347012190,
      "version": 205,
      "versionNonce": 337656905,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "在该形态的第一天（P1），形成了一根创下新低的\n红色蜡烛，巩固了空头在市场中的地位。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "在该形态的第一天（P1），形成了一根创下新低的红色蜡烛，巩固了空头在市场中的地位。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "1WP_QAOytaoehWB0n0rl0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17747.2369233389,
      "y": 1531.8444148472404,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRt9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 252969090,
      "version": 187,
      "versionNonce": 1783056583,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "在该形态的第二天（P2），市场开盘价高于前一\n日收盘价。看到高开盘价，空头感到恐慌，因为他\n们原本预期开盘价会更低。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "在该形态的第二天（P2），市场开盘价高于前一日收盘价。看到高开盘价，空头感到恐慌，因为他们原本预期开盘价会更低。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ffvdsPBpVQLQin1MkxZmG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17747.03886425687,
      "y": 1714.1777278355216,
      "width": 792.39599609375,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRtA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 478920862,
      "version": 204,
      "versionNonce": 927189801,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "P2交易​​时段市场走强，最终收涨，形成一根蓝色K\n线。然而，P2的收盘价略低于前一日（P1）的开\n盘价。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "P2交易​​时段市场走强，最终收涨，形成一根蓝色K线。然而，P2的收盘价略低于前一日（P1）的开盘价。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "RLwRCS2IXdHyXu0LUZGKv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17746.89088452054,
      "y": 1908.511040823803,
      "width": 784.6919555664062,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRtB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 327458882,
      "version": 237,
      "versionNonce": 672176103,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "P2 的价格走势形成了一根小的蓝色蜡烛，它似乎\n包含在 P1 的长红色蜡烛中（如同孕育着它一\n样）。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "P2 的价格走势形成了一根小的蓝色蜡烛，它似乎包含在 P1 的长红色蜡烛中（如同孕育着它一样）。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "4a8CrwoPvNprl00H_BdgM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17743.2369233389,
      "y": 2074.844536917553,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRtC",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1288043742,
      "version": 246,
      "versionNonce": 282230281,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "单独来看，这根小小的蓝色蜡烛看起来无害，但真\n正引起恐慌的是，这根阳线会在最意想不到的时候\n突然出现。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "单独来看，这根小小的蓝色蜡烛看起来无害，但真正引起恐慌的是，这根阳线会在最意想不到的时候突然出现。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hIp3BTLWerknNPJZJcSen",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17743.254928709994,
      "y": 2243.677788870678,
      "width": 791.9639892578125,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRtD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1212893186,
      "version": 233,
      "versionNonce": 2049114887,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "蓝色蜡烛不仅鼓励多头建立多头头寸，也令空头感\n到不安。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "蓝色蜡烛不仅鼓励多头建立多头头寸，也令空头感到不安。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "vMWBy3aYBaKMjSrTgb28h",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17743.2369233389,
      "y": 2366.5111628941154,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRtE",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 720285982,
      "version": 239,
      "versionNonce": 1875367145,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "预计空头恐慌情绪会迅速蔓延，从而更有效地推动\n多头，进而推高股价。因此，投资者应该考虑做多\n该股票。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "预计空头恐慌情绪会迅速蔓延，从而更有效地推动多头，进而推高股价。因此，投资者应该考虑做多该股票。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "B7EABQhZODyHV-Z-FTtZt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17611.23689282132,
      "y": 2580.177849905834,
      "width": 144,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRtF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2046939778,
      "version": 117,
      "versionNonce": 821758503,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "交易设置",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "交易设置",
      "autoResize": true,
