      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "1L4Tp77dR4cjBu2uU7Quj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17718.57023632718,
      "y": 2676.8444148472404,
      "width": 744.47998046875,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRtG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 762625282,
      "version": 285,
      "versionNonce": 934236105,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.做多看涨的孕线形态\n\n2.P1为红色K线 ， P2 为蓝色K线\n\n3.风险承受着 可以在P2收盘前后开始做多交易",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.做多看涨的孕线形态\n\n2.P1为红色K线 ， P2 为蓝色K线\n\n3.风险承受着 可以在P2收盘前后开始做多交易",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
