      "versionNonce": 1319399081,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.确认 P2的开盘价  >  P1的收盘价\n\n2.P2的收盘价  <  P1的开盘价\n\n两者都满足 ，也就是P1包裹住了P2",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.确认 P2的开盘价  >  P1的收盘价\n\n2.P2的收盘价  <  P1的开盘价\n\n两者都满足 ，也就是P1包裹住了P2",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
