      "seed": 1427409986,
      "version": 238,
      "versionNonce": 391684937,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "市场处于上升趋势，多头完全掌控了局面。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "市场处于上升趋势，多头完全掌控了局面。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "6RIzySM_eiiJBUpWksDuX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17807.653549315462,
      "y": 4198.6777583531,
      "width": 796.5,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRtP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 494588126,
      "version": 262,
      "versionNonce": 577556935,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "在P1图表上，市场走高并创下新高，最终收涨，形\n成蓝色K线日。这一交易走势再次确认了多头在市\n场中的主导地位。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "在P1图表上，市场走高并创下新高，最终收涨，形成蓝色K线日。这一交易走势再次确认了多头在市场中的主导地位。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "YzJgAyQ2jZBRBHM9nnUu-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17814.872924925814,
      "y": 4379.511193411694,
      "width": 748.7279663085938,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRtQ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 687715330,
      "version": 248,
      "versionNonce": 618091049,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "P2 市场意外低开，多头被挤出局，引发多头恐\n慌。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "P2 市场意外低开，多头被挤出局，引发多头恐慌。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Z8Sk7lSvHxxEKhwtMv1BX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17818.20291149808,
      "y": 4505.344475882397,
      "width": 742.0679931640625,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRtR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 904463646,
      "version": 263,
      "versionNonce": 882704615,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "市场持续走低，最终收跌，形成一根红色K线。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "市场持续走低，最终收跌，形成一根红色K线。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "laIJGC8adbuUDkFrLBccy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17817.903549315462,
      "y": 4601.177910940991,
      "width": 756,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRtS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1022092226,
      "version": 248,
      "versionNonce": 811410697,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "市场意外的下跌趋势引发恐慌，导致多头纷纷平\n仓。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "市场意外的下跌趋势引发恐慌，导致多头纷纷平仓。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "MTls2Zctpt6ZOvBNxTguV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17818.236984374056,
      "y": 4739.511193411694,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRtT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1124512094,
      "version": 245,
      "versionNonce": 1798982663,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "预计这种负面趋势可能会持续下去，因此应该考虑\n建立空头交易。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "预计这种负面趋势可能会持续下去，因此应该考虑建立空头交易。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "omk9rQr7ey4ZADaZQ9Yhc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17698.903587462435,
