      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.做空,先前的趋势为上涨\n\n2.P1为蓝色   ，  P2为红色",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.做空,先前的趋势为上涨\n\n2.P1为蓝色   ，  P2为红色",
