      "versionNonce": 999056105,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "晨星",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "晨星",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "vXA-lMmams33ccbNCneOF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19345.569830061922,
      "y": 1946.0106695266027,
      "width": 81.50399780273438,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRtl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1826201182,
      "version": 26,
      "versionNonce": 1544444967,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "原理:",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "原理:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Vy8yplKdE2h-2z7GvJLu9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19448.40318882657,
      "y": 2014.344028291251,
      "width": 756,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRtm",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1323322178,
      "version": 92,
      "versionNonce": 2008161737,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "市场处于下跌趋势，空头完全掌控局面。在此期\n间，市场不断创下新低。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "市场处于下跌趋势，空头完全掌控局面。在此期间，市场不断创下新低。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "DJDSsS7ueN0IxzHnGnLUH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19446.48654759122,
      "y": 2115.1773107619542,
      "width": 796.5,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRtn",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1183744478,
      "version": 126,
      "versionNonce": 710819655,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "在该形态的第一天（P1），正如预期，市场创下新\n低并形成一根长长的红色K线。这根长长的红色K\n线表明抛售加速。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "在该形态的第一天（P1），正如预期，市场创下新低并形成一根长长的红色K线。这根长长的红色K线表明抛售加速。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2Xe3d4mrRO71TZHjAW-gY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19449.572546126376,
      "y": 2273.510745820548,
      "width": 770.3280029296875,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRto",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 284791554,
      "version": 113,
      "versionNonce": 1629322409,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "在该形态的第二天（P2），空头占据主导地位，\n开盘出现向下跳空高开。这再次确认了空头的地\n位。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "在该形态的第二天（P2），空头占据主导地位，开盘出现向下跳空高开。这再次确认了空头的地位。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "fSlzySLUMiWS7DxoU48aZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19451.63855564786,
      "y": 2455.1773107619542,
      "width": 776.1959838867188,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRtp",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1130272286,
      "version": 171,
      "versionNonce": 1728364135,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "低开后，当日走势平淡（P2），最终形成十字星\n或纺锤线形态。需要注意的是，十字星/纺锤线的\n出现表明市场犹豫不决。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "低开后，当日走势平淡（P2），最终形成十字星或纺锤线形态。需要注意的是，十字星/纺锤线的出现表明市场犹豫不决。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "N6h7BkgmKnOEOt2aLUXn3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19453.73654759122,
      "y": 2621.844028291251,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRtq",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 403956418,
      "version": 155,
      "versionNonce": 125435785,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "十字星/旋转形态的出现让空头感到有些不安，因\n为他们原本预期会迎来又一个下跌日，尤其是在开\n盘出现有利的跳空缺口的情况下。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "十字星/旋转形态的出现让空头感到有些不安，因为他们原本预期会迎来又一个下跌日，尤其是在开盘出现有利的跳空缺口的情况下。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "fzoQyZNXhoauOia07Ecp1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19456.13056004239,
      "y": 2780.177463349845,
      "width": 787.2119750976562,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRtr",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 228729438,
      "version": 158,
      "versionNonce": 1154374023,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "在该形态的第三天（P3），市场/股票以跳空缺口\n开盘，随后出现一根蓝色蜡烛，该蜡烛成功收于\nP1 红色蜡烛的开盘价之上。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "在该形态的第三天（P3），市场/股票以跳空缺口开盘，随后出现一根蓝色蜡烛，该蜡烛成功收于 P1 红色蜡烛的开盘价之上。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "WjjYR2T0CYW0h40bHnUDR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19458.049810530672,
      "y": 2942.6773107619542,
      "width": 770.0400390625,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRts",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 785267330,
      "version": 176,
      "versionNonce": 2030249577,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如果没有 P2 的十字星/纺锤线，P1 和 P3 看起\n来就像形成了一个看涨吞没形态。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如果没有 P2 的十字星/纺锤线，P1 和 P3 看起来就像形成了一个看涨吞没形态。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "CVVG88mGB1wSG1Gia3tAY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19462.069906355868,
      "y": 3058.5105932326574,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRtt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 405415582,
      "version": 168,
      "versionNonce": 1761054887,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "P3是所有交易活动展开的中心。在跳空高开之\n时，空头可能有些紧张。受跳空高开的鼓舞，买盘\n持续上涨，最终收复了P1的所有失地。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "P3是所有交易活动展开的中心。在跳空高开之时，空头可能有些紧张。受跳空高开的鼓舞，买盘持续上涨，最终收复了P1的所有失地。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "wjIId7tFlgUkywh1PN_RM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19465.161916853915,
      "y": 3227.6773107619542,
      "width": 795.8159790039062,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
