      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "12xG6gGS2l3GKpsfLD4S8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19514.736522159918,
      "y": 3584.6216619582437,
      "width": 939.3479614257812,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRtx",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 340122434,
      "version": 144,
      "versionNonce": 1099616999,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.确认 P1  P2  P3 共同构成  晨星形态  ,与P3收盘时做多",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.确认 P1  P2  P3 共同构成  晨星形态  ,与P3收盘时做多",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "PKMADr1vHIylgJmBGL5Od",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19519.736522159918,
      "y": 3700.455005464103,
      "width": 1041.73193359375,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRty",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1186707102,
      "version": 406,
      "versionNonce": 258831113,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2.为了验证P3晨星的形成\n        \n       a)  P1应该是一个红色的蜡烛线\n\n       b)  如果跳空低开  P2应该是 十字星 或 纺锤线\n\n       c)   P3开盘价为 高开  ，收盘时 当前价格高与P1的开盘价",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2.为了验证P3晨星的形成\n        \n       a)  P1应该是一个红色的蜡烛线\n\n       b)  如果跳空低开  P2应该是 十字星 或 纺锤线\n\n       c)   P3开盘价为 高开  ，收盘时 当前价格高与P1的开盘价",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "XSpKlLLSxl4SGEgL_SSO6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19528.733017668186,
      "y": 4049.4397890826485,
      "width": 427.75201416015625,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
