      "index": "cRu2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1831545991,
      "version": 120,
      "versionNonce": 1238435017,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "原理:",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "原理:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "tWnnbtFG4DaFoXKHzctdq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19573.165295682877,
      "y": 4773.971718873459,
      "width": 648,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRu3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1909639719,
      "version": 191,
      "versionNonce": 994396231,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "市场处于上升趋势，多头占据绝对优势。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "市场处于上升趋势，多头占据绝对优势。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "VLKln8BJJ1e_FNenNlvB8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19572.86094048832,
      "y": 4850.553620731971,
      "width": 596.1959838867188,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRu4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1630769097,
      "version": 221,
      "versionNonce": 2093450153,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "在上升趋势中，市场/股票创下新高。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "在上升趋势中，市场/股票创下新高。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "LcH24A-w41DJiJP_47fce",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19575.99327466244,
      "y": 4945.339200022135,
      "width": 796.5,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRu5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 694480199,
      "version": 327,
      "versionNonce": 941795175,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "在该形态的第一天（P1），正如预期，市场高开，\n创下新高，并收于接近当日高点的位置。第一天\n（P1）形成的长蓝色蜡烛图表明买盘加速上涨。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "在该形态的第一天（P1），正如预期，市场高开，创下新高，并收于接近当日高点的位置。第一天（P1）形成的长蓝色蜡烛图表明买盘加速上涨。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "uTo2aKBDd81eGbVbcOyGt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19573.618531002106,
      "y": 5123.9587837441095,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRu6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1033940649,
      "version": 433,
      "versionNonce": 1313547913,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "在该形态的第二天（ P2），市场以跳空高开，再\n次确认了多头的强势地位。然而，在令人鼓舞的开\n盘之后，市场/股票并未出现波动，最终收盘形成\n十字星/纺锤线形态。P2的收盘走势引发了多头的\n些许恐慌。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "在该形态的第二天（ P2），市场以跳空高开，再次确认了多头的强势地位。然而，在令人鼓舞的开盘之后，市场/股票并未出现波动，最终收盘形成十字星/纺锤线形态。P2的收盘走势引发了多头的些许恐慌。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "sVsTR0oQb3Kal4YuWkfB1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19580.45212793202,
      "y": 5394.709437557269,
      "width": 781.416015625,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRu7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1829088359,
      "version": 300,
      "versionNonce": 1816601223,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "在该形态的第三天（ P3），市场低开，并形成一\n根红色K线。这根长长的红色K线表明卖方占据主\n导地位。P3的价格走势引发了多头的恐慌。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "在该形态的第三天（ P3），市场低开，并形成一根红色K线。这根长长的红色K线表明卖方占据主导地位。P3的价格走势引发了多头的恐慌。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "QabtvU9OWZUScYQlHfLim",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19576.70174048693,
      "y": 5566.833969516867,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRu8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 281473417,
      "version": 242,
      "versionNonce": 957836649,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "预计多头将继续恐慌，因此熊市将在未来几个交易\n日持续。因此，投资者应关注做空机会",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "预计多头将继续恐慌，因此熊市将在未来几个交易日持续。因此，投资者应关注做空机会",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
