      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "与单K和多K 形态不同 风险偏好者 和 规避者 都可以在P3入场",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "与单K和多K 形态不同 风险偏好者 和 规避者 都可以在P3入场",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "XiObGwcpShcGrVWLqDTm-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19632.74848973167,
      "y": 5929.222176354793,
      "width": 1043.2556758907306,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRuD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1994337673,
      "version": 144,
      "versionNonce": 1407990759,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. 在收盘时确认 P1 - P3的昏星形态,快收盘时做空P3",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 在收盘时确认 P1 - P3的昏星形态,快收盘时做空P3",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
