      "text": "总结",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "总结",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "TjVKObD4AKEFGMA7lmOKP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19528.701819823615,
      "y": 6743.478294504679,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRuG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 887044233,
      "version": 143,
      "versionNonce": 628420841,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "风险承担者——风险承担者会在形态形成的最后一\n天，大约在收盘价附近（下午3:20）入场交易。\n交易者需要验证形态规则，如果规则成立，则该交\n易机会符合交易条件。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "风险承担者——风险承担者会在形态形成的最后一天，大约在收盘价附近（下午3:20）入场交易。交易者需要验证形态规则，如果规则成立，则该交易机会符合交易条件。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ArtVJVglE0-mBEVf6QbbC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19537.708487914435,
      "y": 7009.311576975382,
      "width": 787.3199462890625,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRuH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1983197319,
      "version": 97,
      "versionNonce": 1295887911,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "风险厌恶型交易者——风险厌恶型交易者会在第二\n天确认交易信号后才开始交易。做多交易的K线颜\n色应为蓝色，做空交易的K线颜色应为红色。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "风险厌恶型交易者——风险厌恶型交易者会在第二天确认交易信号后才开始交易。做多交易的K线颜色应为蓝色，做空交易的K线颜色应为红色。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "yxbd6wViWfXeBdAJ2C63h",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19535.368461058966,
      "y": 7231.811576975382,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRuI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 391724905,
      "version": 97,
      "versionNonce": 1901652937,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "一般来说，某种形态持续的天数越多，最好在同一\n天开始交易。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "一般来说，某种形态持续的天数越多，最好在同一天开始交易。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9sFvM10MuskMVzhVf-tPM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19535.368461058966,
      "y": 7386.811576975382,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRuJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 359368615,
      "version": 97,
      "versionNonce": 500388167,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "多头交易的止损位设在形态的最低点，空头交易的\n止损位设在形态的最高点。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "多头交易的止损位设在形态的最低点，空头交易的止损位设在形态的最高点。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "uVrFUcQqTLqy11iH06KVr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19555.924542195033,
      "y": 7590.42165387968,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRuK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1253887113,
      "version": 113,
      "versionNonce": 1488620201,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "我的建议是，你要熟悉我们在这里讨论过的这些形\n态。它们是印度市场上最常见、最有利可图的交易\n形态。随着你经验的积累，开始根据多空双方行为\n背后的逻辑来制定交易策略。从长远来看，这可能\n是研究K线图的最佳方法。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "我的建议是，你要熟悉我们在这里讨论过的这些形态。它们是印度市场上最常见、最有利可图的交易形态。随着你经验的积累，开始根据多空双方行为背后的逻辑来制定交易策略。从长远来看，这可能是研究K线图的最佳方法。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
