      "seed": 1592063421,
      "version": 223,
      "versionNonce": 431266697,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "注意，在进行技术分析中的可视化练习（例如识别支撑位和阻力位）\n时，始终存在近似误差的风险。因此，务必预留一定的误差空间",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "注意，在进行技术分析中的可视化练习（例如识别支撑位和阻力位）时，始终存在近似误差的风险。因此，务必预留一定的误差空间",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5WNOrmNSNhkiDWd0iaxQ-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 21300.892779032314,
      "y": 5629.991564069483,
      "width": 684,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRut",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 402290771,
      "version": 85,
      "versionNonce": 2115730823,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "价格水平通常以区间而非单一价格点来表示",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "价格水平通常以区间而非单一价格点来表示",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "utDjy5mqNvpLa_35o0tQk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 21304.226137796963,
      "y": 5742.491869245264,
      "width": 1145.333435058594,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRuu",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2080544381,
      "version": 105,
      "versionNonce": 562709097,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "实际上是指一个区域或范围，该区域或范围起到支撑或阻力的作用",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "实际上是指一个区域或范围，该区域或范围起到支撑或阻力的作用",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "u7xEo407L2TTlZA8liJCl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 21306.05949656161,
      "y": 5861.65843418667,
      "width": 610.595947265625,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRuv",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1025787251,
      "version": 99,
      "versionNonce": 1157641383,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "一般在支撑 / 阻力 价格上  加减 点数",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "一般在支撑 / 阻力 价格上  加减 点数",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "se6jz-cV1shTBbWHOAK5f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 21107.726290384853,
      "y": 5999.992250714991,
      "width": 254.73597717285156,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
