      "seed": 1455837747,
      "version": 40,
      "versionNonce": 835194185,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "S&R的可靠性：",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "S&R的可靠性：",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "vpUhO0VjO-CKG0N1oHmGy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 21246.226332346523,
      "y": 6117.825563703273,
      "width": 1261.3333740234366,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRux",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1106989203,
      "version": 110,
      "versionNonce": 947980231,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "支撑线和阻力线仅指示价格可能反转的方向，绝不能作为价格走势的最终依据",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "支撑线和阻力线仅指示价格可能反转的方向，绝不能作为价格走势的最终依据",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "T6cgJDqos7fIG1pGI9Dfa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 21246.226332346523,
      "y": 6239.15893772671,
      "width": 1290.6666259765618,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRuy",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1256169459,
      "version": 199,
      "versionNonce": 1372159017,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "技术分析中的其他任何因素一样，应该根据形态来评估事件发生的可能性。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "技术分析中的其他任何因素一样，应该根据形态来评估事件发生的可能性。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "iwgLWZrRn3UFkVT-kFsKw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 21243.55970636996,
      "y": 6369.658876691554,
      "width": 1341.251953125,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRuz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 176502579,
      "version": 368,
      "versionNonce": 649754343,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "还有一种情况,当 走势 到一个特定的价格点时遇到阻力，从历史数据看，如果每次\n都踩到 这个点 时， 根据历史往往会重演 , 经过时间的考验了，是一个有效的阻力位",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "还有一种情况,当 走势 到一个特定的价格点时遇到阻力，从历史数据看，如果每次\n都踩到 这个点 时， 根据历史往往会重演 , 经过时间的考验了，是一个有效的阻力位",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ZLOD0OH3VEHcsXCw10jK8",
