      "index": "cRv4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1883652317,
      "version": 146,
      "versionNonce": 778477769,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2.支撑阻力位应该确认交易方向。止损价位应该设在支撑阻力位附近",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2.支撑阻力位应该确认交易方向。止损价位应该设在支撑阻力位附近",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "v0uI2RioIisbvVmR6Ue-h",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 21536.55973688754,
      "y": 7221.825502668116,
      "width": 829.3332519531248,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRv5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2045013629,
      "version": 201,
      "versionNonce": 1231514695,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "对于多头交易而言，形态的低点应该在支撑位附近。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "对于多头交易而言，形态的低点应该在支撑位附近。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2wzHeAleuejrUD0rFk7eb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 21537.89304987582,
      "y": 7325.658754621241,
      "width": 756,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
