      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "价格为什么上涨？",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "价格为什么上涨？",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "YkJ75B4D32P0SNKBp9isX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23412.001108805343,
      "y": 1929.2217559814453,
      "width": 396,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRvP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1670777030,
      "version": 142,
      "versionNonce": 1345064839,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "因为市场参与者正在买入",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "因为市场参与者正在买入",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "PUPKaVJvNuzNlhU01zria",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23234.001047770187,
      "y": 2000.2217559814453,
      "width": 576,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRvQ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1329614490,
      "version": 119,
      "versionNonce": 604229737,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "此次价格上涨是否有机构买家参与？",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "此次价格上涨是否有机构买家参与？",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "SDodlmfJGpxQykTpO1WuK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23418.001047770187,
      "y": 2073.888381958008,
      "width": 144,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRvR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2124742662,
      "version": 170,
      "versionNonce": 1798211239,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "不太可能",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "不太可能",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "H9Y1T1UWK7IxCVXdW6EsR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23238.001078287765,
      "y": 2150.2217559814453,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRvS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1781492570,
      "version": 116,
      "versionNonce": 165665609,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "你怎么知道机构投资者没有进行任何实质性购买？",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "你怎么知道机构投资者没有进行任何实质性购买？",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "xG9-MTl1UMqQiLl-xqgQm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23422.001047770187,
      "y": 2229.388381958008,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRvT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 592645958,
      "version": 187,
      "versionNonce": 1762990535,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "很简单，如果他们真的在购买，那么销量就会增加\n而不是减少",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "很简单，如果他们真的在购买，那么销量就会增加而不是减少",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "uo89wmCjjs5HIE6cvoA7j",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23231.334421793625,
      "y": 2351.5550079345703,
      "width": 648,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRvU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 900584474,
      "version": 92,
      "versionNonce": 834112041,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "销量下降伴随价格上涨，这表明了什么？",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "销量下降伴随价格上涨，这表明了什么？",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "FVzkbJjIUOuQnUKTRvXvo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23409.001047770187,
      "y": 2421.554916381836,
      "width": 1057.333374023437,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRvV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 729099526,
      "version": 307,
      "versionNonce": 251414759,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "这意味着价格上涨是由于零售商参与度低，而非真正具有影响力的\n买家所致。因此，您最好保持谨慎，因为这可能是一个牛市陷阱。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "这意味着价格上涨是由于零售商参与度低，而非真正具有影响力的买家所致。因此，您最好保持谨慎，因为这可能是一个牛市陷阱。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "I0wDgYMdXK4NBdNYhs8ut",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23048.334536234517,
      "y": 2595.5548756917324,
      "width": 1237.89599609375,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
