      "originalText": "不太可能",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Wg2hVU1x18mJKa8q_UAyQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23279.66780344643,
      "y": 3173.721501668295,
      "width": 756,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRvc",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 442313370,
      "version": 142,
      "versionNonce": 2109779369,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "你怎么知道机构投资者没有发出任何有意义的卖\n单？",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "你怎么知道机构投资者没有发出任何有意义的卖单？",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "_EjmEzJE9Flbu2sfNvM_z",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23427.00117746987,
      "y": 3292.38824971517,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRvd",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 626254854,
      "version": 136,
      "versionNonce": 1042881895,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "很简单，如果它们在销售，那么销量就会增加而不\n是减少。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "很简单，如果它们在销售，那么销量就会增加而不是减少。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "IAHXevVJRZnVORFkb0UGn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23280.33449045815,
      "y": 3416.2216237386074,
      "width": 648,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRve",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1968228186,
      "version": 158,
      "versionNonce": 1787760777,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "那么，如何推断价格下降和销量下降呢？",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "那么，如何推断价格下降和销量下降呢？",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ueAqtdqzfl-f_uSr3l2bS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23421.66780344643,
      "y": 3501.0548756917324,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRvf",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1518695238,
      "version": 160,
      "versionNonce": 370071687,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "这意味着价格下跌是因为零售商参与度低，而非真\n正有影响力的（或者说是精明的）投资者抛售。因\n此，谨慎行事很重要，因为这可能是一个空头陷\n阱。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "这意味着价格下跌是因为零售商参与度低，而非真正有影响力的（或者说是精明的）投资者抛售。因此，谨慎行事很重要，因为这可能是一个空头陷阱。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "IAWJ5jnjpyXtWUJlyKrnr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23274.262433510976,
      "y": 3848.4930281712,
      "width": 526.0679931640625,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRvg",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1358347334,
      "version": 101,
      "versionNonce": 961419113,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "该股票应形成可识别的K线形态。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "该股票应形成可识别的K线形态。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bb5U0ZLSoqNgsR80s_9Yf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23275.82873165775,
      "y": 3928.908596201567,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRvh",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1813418778,
      "version": 81,
      "versionNonce": 1540370343,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "支撑位和阻力位应该会确认交易。止损价应该设在\n支撑位和阻力位附近。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "支撑位和阻力位应该会确认交易。止损价应该设在支撑位和阻力位附近。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "DhhwQB0o7a7Ff9ITBOWbz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23282.771322083623,
      "y": 4056.5523943122803,
      "width": 756,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRvi",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1956856710,
      "version": 94,
      "versionNonce": 742998601,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "对于多头交易而言，形态的低点应该在支撑位附\n近。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "对于多头交易而言，形态的低点应该在支撑位附近。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "u1ufI1EkBVd8X98yumWje",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23290.14292846638,
      "y": 4177.209260722023,
      "width": 756,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRvj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 214507482,
      "version": 104,
      "versionNonce": 161063623,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "对于短线交易，形态的高点应该在阻力位附近。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "对于短线交易，形态的高点应该在阻力位附近。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "aAINB4JXm0owqe4Wfhz9r",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23291.809878019518,
      "y": 4344.626911861839,
      "width": 432,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRvk",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1471996614,
      "version": 181,
      "versionNonce": 811340073,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "交易量应与交易情况相符。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "交易量应与交易情况相符。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "sk6TCZbbgfTMsYYXnTfPY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23290.39605565195,
      "y": 4254.036905457156,
      "width": 468,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRvl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 957093018,
      "version": 102,
      "versionNonce": 537375207,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "买卖日成交量均高于平均水平",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "买卖日成交量均高于平均水平",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "R2mL1dbX30lvTdBzQS_Ma",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23303.472403225973,
      "y": 4445.027159760406,
      "width": 792,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRvm",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1021352454,
      "version": 174,
      "versionNonce": 183632905,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "成交量低并非好兆头，因此，如果成交量低，请谨\n慎交易。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "成交量低并非好兆头，因此，如果成交量低，请谨慎交易。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
