      "version": 66,
      "versionNonce": 1825151017,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "什么叫指数移动平均线::EMA",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "什么叫指数移动平均线::EMA",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "SoVGLosN-oXRxIINMQ1F5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 25055.28047192653,
      "y": 1561.7226084537608,
      "width": 1051.199951171875,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRw1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 252336702,
      "version": 287,
      "versionNonce": 1348082407,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5日中的数据中, 第五天的数据相较重要赋予的权重较大\n                  第二天的数据相较次重要赋予的权重次于第五天的",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5日中的数据中, 第五天的数据相较重要赋予的权重较大\n                  第二天的数据相较次重要赋予的权重次于第五天的",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "mEnyoeVKn0TS5gn--CXGw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 25044.46129818683,
      "y": 1715.8958342445071,
      "width": 1467.468017578125,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRw2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 297697534,
      "version": 202,
      "versionNonce": 236366601,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "根据新颖程度,重要程度,我们进行了缩放,基于这组数据的平均值就叫做指数移动平均线(EMA)",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "根据新颖程度,重要程度,我们进行了缩放,基于这组数据的平均值就叫做指数移动平均线(EMA)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "N54QR0wMII9DF9yPcE2xh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 24923.4278454692,
      "y": 1897.7459593425053,
      "width": 1483.6319580078125,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRw3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1512426850,
      "version": 239,
      "versionNonce": 71575047,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "EMA指数移动平均线更重视最新数据,有助于交易中更快的做出交易决策 ,交易者更偏向于EMA",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "EMA指数移动平均线更重视最新数据,有助于交易中更快的做出交易决策 ,交易者更偏向于EMA",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "eAwh2wG_HT7lUHaHqf-pw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 24879.209385626145,
      "y": 2053.9702640279033,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRw4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 900431038,
      "version": 57,
      "versionNonce": 1845387753,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "移动平均线的简单应用",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "移动平均线的简单应用",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "qCbXwOpX1vXbsXssLbL53",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 25090.98160690977,
      "y": 2167.644915099586,
      "width": 684,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRw5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1778363070,
      "version": 52,
      "versionNonce": 1090506023,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "移动平均线本身就具有识别买卖机会的价值",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "移动平均线本身就具有识别买卖机会的价值",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2o1tpWn7siCg2xqc3PPec",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 25097.051899895385,
      "y": 2293.6516503762255,
      "width": 1237.5207787040563,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRw6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1869875426,
      "version": 145,
      "versionNonce": 697056457,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "当股价高于其平均价格时，意味着交易者愿意以高于平均价格的价格买入股票",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "当股价高于其平均价格时，意味着交易者愿意以高于平均价格的价格买入股票",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "XBQgN-ThqG4lwN0mJScJ0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 25103.72645645964,
      "y": 2419.6587675689566,
      "width": 1202.4797863973292,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRw7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 262413218,
      "version": 390,
      "versionNonce": 838438983,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "当股价低于平均价格时，意味着交易者愿意以低于平均价格的价格出售股票",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "当股价低于平均价格时，意味着交易者愿意以低于平均价格的价格出售股票",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "I2EgGflA_lFsS9oPiDZxR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 25109.89567961457,
      "y": 2541.4149268305814,
      "width": 756,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#099268",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRw8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 629562494,
      "version": 145,
      "versionNonce": 811318185,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "可以做一个简易的基于指数移动平均线交易系统",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "可以做一个简易的基于指数移动平均线交易系统",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "q4p17HulHr53viDm4hLn7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 25196.455166632702,
      "y": 2651.5436779554316,
      "width": 1097.424072265625,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRw9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 560474110,
      "version": 236,
      "versionNonce": 1628303207,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "规则1：当市场价格高于均线时 买入做多 ,一旦建仓就要满足必要条件\n\n规则2: 当市场价格低于均线时 平仓",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "规则1：当市场价格高于均线时 买入做多 ,一旦建仓就要满足必要条件\n\n规则2: 当市场价格低于均线时 平仓",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "LCr-gfgy22sih4XmEgVe2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 25127.624721049426,
      "y": 2848.649044852993,
      "width": 707.6519165039062,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRwA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1810473954,
      "version": 319,
      "versionNonce": 1922588297,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "经过不断的实践可以得出一个重要的结论:\n\n           价格呈现趋势时,移动均线表现出色\n\n           价格横盘时,移动均线失效",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "经过不断的实践可以得出一个重要的结论:\n\n           价格呈现趋势时,移动均线表现出色\n\n           价格横盘时,移动均线失效",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "-dzGjdKRGwIIf9FxFDSIB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 24908.99302650652,
      "y": 3152.754468066382,
      "width": 216,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
