    },
    {
      "id": "mGORFJBNEQMv2_Txf7wHY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 26999.651489197757,
      "y": 874.3929019269881,
      "width": 1137.5638427734375,
      "height": 495,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRwK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1784172234,
      "version": 563,
      "versionNonce": 1518282985,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RSI原理：        14天的交易价格[100,102,105,107,103,100.......]\n\n                    第0天的价格为99 那14天的得/失分为[1,2,3,2,-4,-3]\n\n                    平均得分 = 得分总和 / 天数  = 2.07\n\n                    平均失分 = 失分总和  / 天数 = 0.7\n\n                     RS = 2.07 / 0.7 = 2.89 \n\n                     RSI = 100 - [100 / (1+2.89)] = 74.35",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "RSI原理：        14天的交易价格[100,102,105,107,103,100.......]\n\n                    第0天的价格为99 那14天的得/失分为[1,2,3,2,-4,-3]\n\n                    平均得分 = 得分总和 / 天数  = 2.07\n\n                    平均失分 = 失分总和  / 天数 = 0.7\n\n                     RS = 2.07 / 0.7 = 2.89 \n\n                     RSI = 100 - [100 / (1+2.89)] = 74.35",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "oxTWEAkCONoINgyWVCxeW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 26888.395153491132,
      "y": 395.79415210340716,
      "width": 812.4119873046875,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRwL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1052072278,
      "version": 93,
      "versionNonce": 1863513639,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RSI: 一种领先的动量指标，有助于识别趋势反转。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "RSI: 一种领先的动量指标，有助于识别趋势反转。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "gtb4zipm9enDKOfUuWLyw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 27042.51108117444,
      "y": 1416.0309955323369,
      "width": 788.5079956054688,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRwM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1775223830,
      "version": 84,
      "versionNonce": 2019304393,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "使用RSI的目的是帮助交易者识别超买超卖区域，",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "使用RSI的目的是帮助交易者识别超买超卖区域，",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "KCy7P_lVFaA4l9MKJPH24",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 27042.962306958772,
      "y": 1497.6455260934024,
      "width": 1209.166706139487,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRwN",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1325914070,
      "version": 206,
      "versionNonce": 1707055431,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "超买意味着股票的上涨动能过强，可能无法长期维持，因此价格可能出现回\n调。同样，超卖表明下跌动能过强，可能导致价格反转。",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "超买意味着股票的上涨动能过强，可能无法长期维持，因此价格可能出现回调。同样，超卖表明下跌动能过强，可能导致价格反转。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "WFGrK6Y9rLumrCczeZw98",
