      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RSI 刻度上限为100  下限为0",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "RSI 刻度上限为100  下限为0",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "HRkuCX3W2Yv-64uSKhZfG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 27272.88138804912,
      "y": 1868.7354357860659,
      "width": 984.780029296875,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRwQ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 706451210,
      "version": 247,
      "versionNonce": 2111473033,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RSI读数如果介于 0  - 30 之间为 超卖： 可能出现上涨回调\n\nRSI读数如果介于 70 - 100之间为 超买 :  可能出现下跌回调",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "RSI读数如果介于 0  - 30 之间为 超卖： 可能出现上涨回调\n\nRSI读数如果介于 70 - 100之间为 超买 :  可能出现下跌回调",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "sGqtwjKoz6PbHJf6s2mJV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 27282.524796243833,
      "y": 2071.782752775609,
      "width": 813.5999755859375,
      "height": 495,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cRwR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1221965078,
      "version": 449,
      "versionNonce": 1193358215,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795105057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.如果 RSI 短暂停留在 超买区域   可以做空\n\n  如果长时间停留 ,做多\n\n  如果 长时间远离超买区域开始回落 寻找做空机会\n\n2.如果RSI 短暂停留在超卖区域   可以做多\n\n   如果长时间停留 做空\n\n   如果长时间远离超卖区域  做多",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.如果 RSI 短暂停留在 超买区域   可以做空\n\n  如果长时间停留 ,做多\n\n  如果 长时间远离超买区域开始回落 寻找做空机会\n\n2.如果RSI 短暂停留在超卖区域   可以做多\n\n   如果长时间停留 做空\n\n   如果长时间远离超卖区域  做多",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "zymX-_U4X1OK4Nipo5wqG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 27223.2356994593,
      "y": 2643.4226915617314,
      "width": 842.8679809570312,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
