      "text": "Bitcoin v0.1软件",
      "fontSize": 31.6822511887188,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Bitcoin v0.1软件",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "UVhAERHDdQEV-fGR9BJnZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -7757.7027067430045,
      "y": 11019.534044154916,
      "width": 510.7812253031342,
      "height": 158.41125594359394,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "3cTKLnNvZ5MVtZd5MUNn5",
      "index": "cRxUK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 695336777,
      "version": 1328,
      "versionNonce": 8019367,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795131615,
      "created": 1791637710056,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "这个软件包括生成密钥/地址/挖矿\n\n转账/保存账本/连接其他节点等全部\n核心功能",
      "fontSize": 31.68225118871879,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "这个软件包括生成密钥/地址/挖矿\n\n转账/保存账本/连接其他节点等全部\n核心功能",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "B4piXtWAY-k0A5BgFOVDw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -7741.666054967076,
      "y": 11271.818708573643,
      "width": 679.4891699112585,
      "height": 118.80844195769544,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "3cTKLnNvZ5MVtZd5MUNn5",
      "index": "cRxUO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1256616359,
      "version": 1469,
      "versionNonce": 885919943,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795131615,
      "created": 1791638023426,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "私钥：一串256位随机数，控制btc的唯一凭证\n        谁拥有了私钥谁就拥有了对应地址的BTC\n        不能泄露给别人",
      "fontSize": 31.6822511887188,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "私钥：一串256位随机数，控制btc的唯一凭证\n        谁拥有了私钥谁就拥有了对应地址的BTC\n        不能泄露给别人",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "MjIEJwq8sRrpaxYnGHFwL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -7744.59959674381,
      "y": 11430.229964517237,
      "width": 704.0500264159732,
      "height": 79.20562797179697,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "3cTKLnNvZ5MVtZd5MUNn5",
      "index": "cRxUS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1892243495,
      "version": 1311,
      "versionNonce": 108945383,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795131615,
      "created": 1791638113605,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "公钥：由私钥产生，相当于账号，别人可以通过公\n钥来验证签名",
      "fontSize": 31.6822511887188,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "公钥：由私钥产生，相当于账号，别人可以通过公钥来验证签名",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "rDB-o2vjNV5fZYA-RlY7d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -7738.732513190345,
      "y": 11585.707678684097,
      "width": 704.0500264159732,
      "height": 118.80844195769544,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "3cTKLnNvZ5MVtZd5MUNn5",
      "index": "cRxUV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 172840967,
      "version": 1415,
      "versionNonce": 1469565703,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795131615,
      "created": 1791638172444,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "数字签名: 用私钥对交易内容进行签名，生成一段\n独一无二的密码学字符串，全节点来验证这个签\n名，证明这笔交易是我授权的",
      "fontSize": 31.6822511887188,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "数字签名: 用私钥对交易内容进行签名，生成一段独一无二的密码学字符串，全节点来验证这个签名，证明这笔交易是我授权的",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "l_PIMpYBTLAtDr46X56pJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -7743.035065002776,
      "y": 11770.52081061829,
      "width": 704.0500264159732,
      "height": 277.21969790128946,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "3cTKLnNvZ5MVtZd5MUNn5",
      "index": "cRxUZ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 213359881,
      "version": 1382,
      "versionNonce": 345428519,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795131615,
      "created": 1791638256523,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "节点:运行btc软件的电脑，节点负责验证交易，保\n存账本，广播信息\n    全节点:保存从创世块到现在的完整账本,能独立\n验证所有交易和区块,比特币网络的“记账员”之一\n    轻钱包（Light Wallet） ：不保存完整账本，\n只保存自己的私钥，需要向全节点查询与自己相关\n的交易信息，方便但依赖他人",
      "fontSize": 31.6822511887188,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "节点:运行btc软件的电脑，节点负责验证交易，保存账本，广播信息\n    全节点:保存从创世块到现在的完整账本,能独立验证所有交易和区块,比特币网络的“记账员”之一\n    轻钱包（Light Wallet） ：不保存完整账本，只保存自己的私钥，需要向全节点查询与自己相关的交易信息，方便但依赖他人",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "BUYXb2hudc3cVmwQ6Mpwm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -7737.950202557535,
      "y": 12107.291370777435,
      "width": 704.0500264159732,
      "height": 158.41125594359394,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "3cTKLnNvZ5MVtZd5MUNn5",
      "index": "cRxUd",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1502359465,
      "version": 1199,
      "versionNonce": 1718089031,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795131615,
      "created": 1791638422051,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "广播（Broadcast）\n你把签好名的交易发给连接到的节点，节点验证后\n再转发给其他节点，像“一传十，十传百”一样，几\n分钟内传遍全网。",
      "fontSize": 31.6822511887188,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "广播（Broadcast）\n你把签好名的交易发给连接到的节点，节点验证后再转发给其他节点，像“一传十，十传百”一样，几分钟内传遍全网。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "LkK_JDrWH9N78LTAt4Q-b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -7735.994537881243,
      "y": 12315.572836925494,
      "width": 704.0500264159732,
      "height": 198.01406992949248,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "3cTKLnNvZ5MVtZd5MUNn5",
      "index": "cRxUh",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 164142313,
      "version": 1228,
      "versionNonce": 610776167,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795131615,
      "created": 1791638441611,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "UTXO（未花费交易输出）\n比特币没有“账户余额”的概念，你的“钱”是一堆别\n人转给你、且你还没花掉的UTXO。每个UTXO就\n像一张“钞票”。你要转账时，必须把一张或多张“\n钞票”整个投进去，多余的找零给自己。",
      "fontSize": 31.6822511887188,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "UTXO（未花费交易输出）\n比特币没有“账户余额”的概念，你的“钱”是一堆别人转给你、且你还没花掉的UTXO。每个UTXO就像一张“钞票”。你要转账时，必须把一张或多张“钞票”整个投进去，多余的找零给自己。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "fE6YUlS-x4czllcFGXQLA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -8652.293886068073,
      "y": 11336.389530521581,
      "width": 574.9474149465731,
      "height": 305.1335921599181,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "3cTKLnNvZ5MVtZd5MUNn5",
      "index": "cRxUl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 155974057,
      "version": 1170,
      "versionNonce": 107122567,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791795131615,
      "created": 1791639293669,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "区块头\n1.版本号：4个字节\n2.前一区块的哈希：32字节\n  创世块的值0000000000......\n3.默克尔根：32字节\n4.时间戳 4字节\n5.难度目标 4字节\n6.随机数",
      "fontSize": 30.513359215991816,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "区块头\n1.版本号：4个字节\n2.前一区块的哈希：32字节\n  创世块的值0000000000......\n3.默克尔根：32字节\n4.时间戳 4字节\n5.难度目标 4字节\n6.随机数",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
